officials, where the crowd could easily be mistaken for the audience at a Coldplay concert (his metaphor) and the loudest cheers are for Jack Nicholson.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '40', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/05/magazine/05simmons1/mag-05Simmons-t_CA1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/05/magazine/05simmons1/mag-05Simmons-t_CA1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/05/magazine/05simmons1/mag-05Simmons-t_CA1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Can Bill Simmons Win the Big One?', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'CAN BILL SIMMONS BIG ONE?', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ESPN', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Simmons, Bill (1969- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Magazines', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-01T03:00:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jonathan Mahler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jonathan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mahler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/62be5e07-dc23-578b-8733-75b217b718ae', 'word_count': 4595, 'uri': 'nyt://article/62be5e07-dc23-578b-8733-75b217b718ae'}, {'abstract': 'NYT: Front Page for 06/01/2011', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/audio/20