ickly became notable not so much for Miami’s victory over Dallas as for the instantaneous rush to proclaim the Heat all but unbeatable. On the flip side, the Mavericks are clearly overmatched, unworthy of LeBron James’s talcum powder and already booking a room for the pity party. Yes, it is a time-worn tradition to freak out after Game 1 of any playoff series, with orthopedists lining up to treat all of the sprained knee-jerk muscles, but this time it’s so egregious, perhaps surgeons should be on standby.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Flashbacks to 2006', 'kicker': 'Leading Off', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Flashbacks to 2006', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tressel, Jim', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ohio State University', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nowitzki, Dirk', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Hockey League', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Boston Bruins', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Basketball Assn', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Vancouver Canucks', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Dallas Mavericks', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Miami Heat', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'James, LeBron', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Luongo, Roberto', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Playoff Games', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wade, Dwyane', 'rank': 15, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-01T16:07:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'se