ps://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/01/tony-bennett-to-perform-at-metropolitan-opera/', 'snippet': 'The concert, scheduled for Sept. 18, will celebrate Mr. Bennett’s 85th birthday and mark his debut on the opera house’s stage.', 'lead_paragraph': ' How’s this for rags to riches: The Queens-born tenor and son of a grocer Anthony Dominick Benedetto – you might know him better as the enduring pop crooner Tony Bennett – will make his debut on the stage of the Metropolitan Opera House at a concert in September, the Met said on Wednesday. The concert, scheduled for Sept. 18, will celebrate Mr. Bennett’s 85th birthday (which officially arrives on Aug. 3) and promote his coming album “Duets II,” which is planned for release on Sept. 20. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tony Bennett to Perform at Metropolitan Opera', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Birthdays', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Opera', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bennett, Tony', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Metropolitan Opera', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-01T16:24:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e4a8b246-8797-5da1-ae99-1f18bcbaa735', 'word_count': 200, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e4a8b246-8797-5da1-ae99-1f18bcbaa735'}, {'abstract': 'Governing Class: A state ethics panel sanctions a sitting lawmaker for the first time; and Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg seems to be enjoying his time in the Brazilian sun.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.bl