t as little as $10 a month toward the purchase of a company’s stock – sort of like a Christmas club savings plan for little guys in the market. The fees are carried by the stock-issuing comp...', 'lead_paragraph': 'Loyal3, a San Francisco-based start-up, seems like a mash-up of much of what’s hot in the Web world these days – social networking, stock-market investing, customer loyalty tactics, and micropayments.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Investing Online $10 at a Time', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Nasdaq Stock Market', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-01T19:55:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steve Lohr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steve', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lohr', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5df123d2-c3dc-5536-9377-5dca6870f2e3', 'word_count': 553, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5df123d2-c3dc-5536-9377-5dca6870f2e3'}, {'abstract': 'Lip quenchers and glosses in shades just right for summer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/02/fashion/new-lipsticks-for-summer-beauty-spots.html', 'snippet': 'Lip quenchers and glosses in shades just right for summer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GIRLISH GLOSSES  MAC’s spring and summer collections offer some pastel-hued lip glosses that look straight out of Willy Wonka’s factory. From the Fashion Flower Collection come three new LipGelée colors in pale pink, coral and yellow ($14.50 each). And from the Surf Baby Collection there are four new Lipglass options, including the pale white-gold Girl on Board and the soft coral pink Strange Potion ($15.50 each).', 'pr