n’t enough to record a young hawk’s wanderings.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/01/hawk-cam-pips-still-there-even-if-out-of-sight/', 'snippet': 'Even two cameras aren’t enough to record a young hawk’s wanderings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The good news — great news, in fact — is that Pip the red-tailed hawk, who turned three weeks old last Friday, is getting more and more adventurous as he or she gears up to learn to fly (expect takeoff in mid-to-late-June). The bad news is that our Hawk Cam is seeing less and less of Pip — which means you are, too.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hawk Cam | Pip’s Still There, Even if Out of Sight', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cameras', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hawks (Birds)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York University', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-01T20:10:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andy Newman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Newman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cda1f3c7-0943-5454-8b58-390d906bfb1a', 'word_count': 363, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cda1f3c7-0943-5454-8b58-390d906bfb1a'}, {'abstract': 'Germany has a deadly E. coli outbreak; Representative Anthony Weiner now says he’s uncertain if that Twitter photo is of him; and how Lady Gaga’s new album sold more than a million copies in a week.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/multimedia/100000000844752/timescast--june-1-2011.html', 'snippet': 'Germany has a deadly E. coli outbreak; Representative Anthony Weiner now says he’s uncertain if that Twitter photo i