nam. Here is a little roundup of further reading by and about her.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the Lives page this past Sunday, the novelist Karen Russell wrote about visiting the Cu Chi Tunnels in Vietnam. Here is a little roundup of further reading by and about her:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Russellandia!', 'kicker': 'The 6th Floor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Writing and Writers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Russell, Karen (1981- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-01T21:03:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Glassie', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Glassie', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3b89d539-04b6-5ca4-ae10-e98fa52599e6', 'word_count': 161, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3b89d539-04b6-5ca4-ae10-e98fa52599e6'}, {'abstract': 'Massey Energy shareholders voted to sell the company to Alpha Natural Resources, despite efforts by some investors to block the deal.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2011/06/01/shareholders-approve-massey-sale-to-alpha/', 'snippet': 'Massey Energy shareholders voted to sell the company to Alpha Natural Resources, despite efforts by some investors to block the deal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Shareholders of Massey Energy voted on Wednesday to approve the coal miner’s $7.1 billion sale to Alpha Natural Resources, despite the protests of several shareholders that sued to temporarily halt the deal.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Shareholders Approve Massey Sale to Alpha', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 's