ions', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computer Security', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Google Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hackers (Computers)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-01T21:05:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Markoff and David Barboza', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Markoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barboza', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/705b732f-5b27-517a-ab44-b5e7bbd752f8', 'word_count': 1053, 'uri': 'nyt://article/705b732f-5b27-517a-ab44-b5e7bbd752f8'}, {'abstract': 'What does Cheri Daniels have in common with Elizabeth Taylor and Natalie Wood?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/02/fashion/02Parallel.html', 'snippet': 'What does Cheri Daniels have in common with Elizabeth Taylor and Natalie Wood?', 'lead_paragraph': 'One was a former child star who grew up to be one of the most beautiful actresses in Hollywood. Another was a former child star who grew up to be one of the most beautiful actresses in Hollywood. The third is the spouse of the two-term governor of Indiana, who, until a few weeks ago, was considered by many as a leading candidate for the Republican Party’s presidential nomination. But what does Cheri Daniels have in common with Elizabeth Taylor and Natalie Wood? Like them, she divorced one husband to marry another, only later to remarry the first husband. That marital roundelay, though almost never discussed by the couple, was largely considered one reason Governor Daniels decided against a White House run. As he explained last month: “I find myself caught between two duties. I love my country. I love my family more.”', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/02/fashion/02PARALLEL-span/Z-PARALLEL-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/02/fashion/02PARALLEL-span/Z-PARALLEL-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/02/fashion/02PARALLEL-span/Z-PARALLEL-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 720, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/02/fashion/02PARALLEL-span/Z-PARALLEL-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/02/fashion/02PARALLEL-span/Z-PARALLEL-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'With These Rings', 'kicker': 'Parallel Lives', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'With These Rings', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Daniels, Cheri', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marriages', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Taylor, Elizabeth', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wood, Natalie', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-01T21:08:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stuart Emmrich', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stuart', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Emmrich'