led the same time as service disruptions on the L line.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In its brief, half-decade history, the Bushwick Open Studios festival has earned a reputation as an eclectic, unpredictable entrée into the underground Brooklyn arts scene, replete with cabarets, outré costumes, and free exhibitions from hundreds of local artists.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For an Underground Arts Show, No Subway Service. Again.', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Subways', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Metropolitan Transportation Authority', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bushwick (NYC)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-01T23:04:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael M. Grynbaum', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/281cdd8c-86da-593e-b99b-7398d38ad79f', 'word_count': 566, 'uri': 'nyt://article/281cdd8c-86da-593e-b99b-7398d38ad79f'}, {'abstract': 'A. J. Burnett followed wins by Freddy Garcia and Bartolo Colon, and Nick Swisher hit a three-run homer as the Yankees swept three games from the Athletics.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/02/sports/baseball/yankees-take-another-shot-at-their-punching-bag-and-sweep-oakland.html', 'snippet': 'A. J. Burnett followed wins by Freddy Garcia and Bartolo Colon, and Nick Swisher hit a three-run homer as the Yankees swept three games from the Athletics.', 'lead_paragraph': 'OAKLAND, Calif. — It was the starters on the Oakland Athletics who were supposed to dominate this three-game series, a fledgling and talented bunch, none older than 25, all ranking among the American League’s top 11 in earned run average. The Yankees countered with three pitchers, all 34 or older, none ranking in the A.L.’s top 30 in E.R.A.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/02/sports/01yankees-2/01yankees-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 755, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/02/sports/01yankees-2/01yankees-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/02/sports/01yankees-2/01yankees-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Yankees Ride Sparkling Starters to a Sweep', 'kicker': 'Yankees 4, Athletics 2', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Yankees Ride Sparkling Starters to a Sweep', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Burnett, A J', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Oakland Athletics', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Swisher, Nick', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-01T23:05:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Shpigel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shpigel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id':