e Bronx, where she had lived most of her life. She was 89.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/02/us/YALOW-obit/YALOW-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/02/us/YALOW-obit/YALOW-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/02/us/YALOW-obit/YALOW-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Rosalyn S. Yalow, Nobel Medical Physicist, Dies at 89', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rosalyn S. Yalow, Nobel Medical Physicist, Dies at 89', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bronx (NYC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nobel Prizes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yalow, Rosalyn S', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Research', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Science and Technology', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-02T00:29:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Denise Gellene', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Denise', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gellene', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt