stract': 'General Motors disapproves of a practice whereby some dealers outside of the Volt’s launch markets are purchasing Volts elsewhere and selling them as used, without the federal tax credit.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/02/over-g-m-s-objections-dealers-sell-used-chevy-volts-without-7500-tax-credit/', 'snippet': 'General Motors disapproves of a practice whereby some dealers outside of the Volt’s launch markets are purchasing Volts elsewhere and selling them as used, without the federal tax credit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'According to a recent report by Mark Modica, published by the nonprofit National Legal and Policy Center, some Chevrolet dealers are selling Volts to other dealers and claiming the maximum $7,500 green-vehicle federal tax credit for themselves.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Over G.M.’s Objections, Dealers Sell “Used” Chevy Volts Without $7,500 Tax Credit', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tax Credits, Deductions and Exemptions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chevrolet Division of General Motors Corp', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'General Motors', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Internal Revenue Service', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-02T10:00:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mary M. Chapman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/718b16a7-f0d2-5754-9c63-1551bb9158b0', 'word_count': 972, 'uri': 'nyt://article/718b16a7-