Sharapova, 6-4, 7-5, to become the first Chinese woman to advance to a final at Roland Garros.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/03/sports/tennis/2011-french-open-li-to-meet-schiavone-in-final.html', 'snippet': 'Li Na beat Maria Sharapova, 6-4, 7-5, to become the first Chinese woman to advance to a final at Roland Garros.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — Maria Sharapova was pin-drop quiet, which was both welcome and eerie for anyone who has listened to her shrieks and wails and “come onnns” echo through the chambers of Grand Slam tournaments all these years.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/03/sports/yWOMEN1/yWOMEN1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 327, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/03/sports/yWOMEN1/yWOMEN1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 327}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/03/sports/yWOMEN1/yWOMEN1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 774, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/03/sports/yWOMEN1/yWOMEN1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/03/sports/yWOMEN1/yWOMEN1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Li Is First Chinese Woman in French Final', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Li Becomes First Chinese Woman to Reach French Final', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schiavone, Francesca', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'n