7f3-04d0-5f79-90ed-7a4102b0657a'}, {'abstract': 'The unexpected report from Moody’s puts a spur to sputtering talks between party leaders and the White House to reach an agreement on a long-term deficit-reduction plan.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/03/us/politics/03congress.html', 'snippet': 'The unexpected report from Moody’s puts a spur to sputtering talks between party leaders and the White House to reach an agreement on a long-term deficit-reduction plan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Moody’s Investors Service warned Thursday that it might downgrade the United States government’s sterling credit rating if Congress did not increase the nation’s debt limit “in coming weeks,” putting a spur to the sputtering talks between party leaders and the White House on a plan to restore fiscal stability.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Moody’s Warns of Downgrade for U.S. Credit', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Moody’s Warns Of Downgrade For U.S. Credit', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Credit and Debt', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Moody's Investors Service Inc", 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'National Debt (US)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Budget (US)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-02T20:10:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jackie Calmes and Carl Hulse', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jackie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Calmes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '',