, 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2011/06/02/groupon-c-e-o-to-make-575-in-2011/', 'snippet': 'Groupon’s I.P.O. filing reveals yet another unusual quirk of its chief executive, Andrew D. Mason: He’ll only receive $575 in base salary this year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Andrew D. Mason, Groupon’s eccentric chief executive, is presiding over one of the hottest tech companies of the moment.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Groupon Chief to Make $575 in 2011', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Groupon', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-02T21:15:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael J. de la Merced', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'de la Merced', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2784ad84-19c0-5490-8f24-d76a03d0e93b', 'word_count': 299, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2784ad84-19c0-5490-8f24-d76a03d0e93b'}, {'abstract': 'Photographs from Libya, Somalia, Japan and Georgia.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/02/pictures-of-the-day-libya-and-elsewhere-26/', 'snippet': 'Photographs from Libya, Somalia, Japan and Georgia.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Photographs from Libya, Somalia, Japan and Georgia.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pictures of the Day: Libya and Elsewhere', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-06-02T21:20:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 