sports/tennis/multiple-milestones-at-stake-in-mens-semifinals.html', 'snippet': 'Rafael Nadal, Novak Djokovic, Roger Federer and Andy Murray make for a striking quartet.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — The focus in men’s tennis has shifted at this Grand Slam tournament. For years, it has been on Roger Federer and Rafael Nadal, but this time — from practice courts to match day — the emphasis has been on the game’s third man turned essential man: Novak Djokovic.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/03/sports/men/men-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 765, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/03/sports/men/men-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/03/sports/men/men-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'For Men, Shot at Final Is Just a Part of the Stakes', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Men’s Semifinals, a Shot at the Prize Is Just Part of the Stakes', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Federer, Roger', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'French Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Murray, Andy (1987- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nadal, Rafael', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Djokovic, Novak', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-03T00:39:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original':