: 'nyt://article/d4c4b09d-27dd-5925-bdd1-e27c974d4e9a'}, {'abstract': 'Why obesity affects economic success, government unveils nutrition plate, hackers claim to breach another Sony site and other consumer-focused news from The New York Times.', 'web_url': 'https://bucks.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/03/friday-reading-why-obesity-can-affect-economic-success/', 'snippet': 'Why obesity affects economic success, government unveils nutrition plate, hackers claim to breach another Sony site and other consumer-focused news from The New York Times.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A variety of consumer-focused articles appears daily in The New York Times and online in our blogs. Each weekday morning, we gather them together here so you can quickly scan the news that could hit you in your wallet. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Friday Reading: Why Obesity Can Affect Economic Success', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-06-03T12:18:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ann Carrns', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ann', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carrns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cd5e56ec-1baa-539b-844a-6ec137576f16', 'word_count': 118, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cd5e56ec-1baa-539b-844a-6ec137576f16'}, {'abstract': 'Seeking a new logo, the Department of Interior turns to crowd-sourcing and gets the public creatively involved.', 'web_url': 'https://green.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/03/sketching-a-new-home-for-the-buffalo/', 'snippet': 'Seeking a new logo, the Department of Interior turns to crowd-sourcing and gets the public creatively involved.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Got a flair for graphic design and a passion for buffalo? The Interior Department ha