/5d09883f-0010-5f84-8132-9b45841fd4fb', 'word_count': 1111, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5d09883f-0010-5f84-8132-9b45841fd4fb'}, {'abstract': 'BLK DNM, a new clothing line by Swedish import Johan Lindeberg, will soon have a temporary home at Pop 1 in SoHo.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/03/extra-extra-lindeberg-has-landed/', 'snippet': 'BLK DNM, a new clothing line by Swedish import Johan Lindeberg, will soon have a temporary home at Pop 1 in SoHo.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s big news when the Swedish import Johan Lindeberg, former C.E.O. of Diesel and creator of the popular J. Lindeberg label, celebrates a new project. His vowel-free clothing line, BLK DNM, a well-edited collection of downtown must-haves for men and women (available at us.blkdnm.com), \xa0will soon have a temporary home at Pop 1 in SoHo, starting June 8.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Extra! Extra! Lindeberg Has Landed!', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-06-03T13:00:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bruce Pask', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bruce', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pask', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/30b61dc8-e0f3-5f92-b4cc-fd05ef61a36d', 'word_count': 165, 'uri': 'nyt://article/30b61dc8-e0f3-5f92-b4cc-fd05ef61a36d'}, {'abstract': 'In Tikrit, the hometown of Saddam Hussein, an imam and several local government officials are among 19 people killed in the attacks.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/04/world/middleeast/04iraq.html', 'snippet': 'In Tikrit, the hometown of Saddam Hussein, an imam and several local government officials are among 19 people killed in the attacks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BAGHDAD