t': 'St. Ann’s Warehouse, the Brooklyn theater whose plan for a new home was blocked, is facing an uncertain future: It is scheduled to leave its current home next May, but now has no alternative space to move to.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/04/theater/st-anns-warehouse-in-brooklyn-facing-a-nomadic-future.html', 'snippet': 'St. Ann’s Warehouse, the Brooklyn theater whose plan for a new home was blocked, is facing an uncertain future: It is scheduled to leave its current home next May, but now has no alternative space to move to.', 'lead_paragraph': 'St. Ann’s Warehouse, the Brooklyn theater whose versatile and cavernous playing space has become a magnet for New York and overseas acting troupes, is now confronting a likely fate that its leaders had worked years to avoid: homelessness.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/04/arts/WAREHOUSE/WAREHOUSE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 177, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/04/arts/WAREHOUSE/WAREHOUSE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 177}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/04/arts/WAREHOUSE/WAREHOUSE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 303, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/04/arts/WAREHOUSE/WAREHOUSE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/04/arts/WAREHOUSE/WAREHOUSE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'St. Ann’s Warehouse Scrambles to Find New Home', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'St