ri': 'nyt://article/53de26a3-c162-5c2d-b83c-220df45ea0b7'}, {'abstract': 'On April 3, inspired by an essay titled “Why We Travel” by Paul Theroux, we asked readers to write us with their answers to that question. Hundreds responded. Here are the selected submissions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/05/travel/why-we-travel.html', 'snippet': 'On April 3, inspired by an essay titled “Why We Travel” by Paul Theroux, we asked readers to write us with their answers to that question. Hundreds responded. Here are the selected submissions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ON April 3, along with the essay\xa0 by Paul Theroux titled “Why We Travel,” readers were asked to submit essays of their own to answer this question. Several hundred responded, relating stories that took us from the mountains of Peru to the halls of Rome. Here are the final selections that illustrate the vast range of our readers’ experiences. Thanks to everyone who responded; it was a pleasure to read of your travels. The Editors', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/05/travel/05reader-span/05reader-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 375, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/05/travel/05reader-span/05reader-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 375}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/05/travel/05reader-span/Reader-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 668, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/05/travel/05reader-span/05reader-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/05/travel/05reader-span/05reader-span-t