owboy,” “The Day of the Locust” and “The English Patient,” for which she won an Oscar. Ms. Roth is working on the film version of “Extremely Loud and Incredibly Close,” starring Tom Hanks, and is nominated for a Tony Award for best costume design of a musical for “The Book of Mormon.” The ceremony is June 12.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/05/fashion/WHATIWORE/WHATIWORE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 682, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/05/fashion/WHATIWORE/WHATIWORE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/05/fashion/WHATIWORE/WHATIWORE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Something for Every Role', 'kicker': 'What I Wore | Ann Roth', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Something for Every Role', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Roth, Ann', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-03T20:29:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bee-Shyuan Chang', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bee-shyuan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Chang', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6bcb4e8f-d868-50b2-ac79-723995262f37', 'word_count': 909, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6bcb4e8f-d868-50b2-ac79-723995262f37'}, {'abstract': 'Dr. Harold Koplewicz says that his main mission in life is to remove any stigma from mental illness among children and teenagers, as he raises money for his center.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/05/fashion/when-a-childs-anxieties-need-sorting.html', 'snippet': 'Dr. Harold Koplewicz says that his main mission in life is to remove any stigma from mental illness among children and teenagers, as he raises money for his center.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WHEN the 10-year-old son of Brooke Garber Neidich, a chairwoman at the Whitney Museum, was having difficulty in school, there was only one person who was able to give him a proper diagnosis: Dr. Harold Koplewicz. ', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/05/fashion/KOPLEWICZ/KOPLEWICZ-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/05/fashion/KOPLEWICZ/KOPLEWICZ-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/05/fashion/KOPLEWICZ/KOPLEWICZ-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/05/fashion/KOPLEWICZ/KOPLEWICZ-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/05/fashion/KOPLEWICZ/KOPLEWICZ-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'When a Child’s Anxieties Need Sorting', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'When a Child’s Anxieties Need Sorting', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Psychiatry and Psychiatrists', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value':