2ad-b581-c6b6d87a2f86', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/776816de-8336-52ad-b581-c6b6d87a2f86'}, {'abstract': '“Treme,” HBO’s drama about post-Katrina New Orleans, follows a chef who goes to New York and features writing by Anthony Bourdain.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/05/arts/television/treme-on-hbo-focuses-on-food.html', 'snippet': '“Treme,” HBO’s drama about post-Katrina New Orleans, follows a chef who goes to New York and features writing by Anthony Bourdain.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THINK of New Orleans, and you just might think of jazz. Which is what “Treme,” HBO’s drama about loss and renewal post-Katrina, built its reputation on in its inaugural season, with stories about struggling musicians and a radio D.J., and lengthy interludes showcasing some of the city’s performers.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/05/arts/TREME-1/TREME-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/05/arts/TREME-1/TREME-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/05/arts/TREME-1/TREME-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/05/arts/TREME-1/TREME-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/05/arts/TREME-1/TREME-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘Treme’ Sharpens Its Focus on Food', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '‘Treme’ Sharpens Its Focus On Food