ffense and defense, taking credit and deflecting blame.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/04/business/subObama/subObama-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/04/business/subObama/subObama-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Obama Lauds Bailout at Visit to Chrysler Plant', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Obama Lauds Bailout at Visit to Chrysler Plant', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Factories and Manufacturing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Toledo (Ohio)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-04T01:34:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jackie Calmes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jackie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Calmes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0662fbd9-6ea6-5c50-bdfb-9cb1f83071a7', 'word_count': 1032, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0662fbd9-6ea6-5c50-bdfb-9cb1f83071a7'}, {'abstract': 'Defense Secretary Robert M. Gates pledged that the United States would sustain its military presence and diplomatic involvement in Asia.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/04/world/asia/04gates.html', 'snippet': 'Defense Secretary Robert M. Gates pledged that the United States would sustain its military presence and diplomatic involvement in Asia.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SINGAPORE — Defense Secretary Robert M. Gates pledged Saturday that the United States would sustain its military presence and diplomatic involvement in Asia, as he sought to calm regional worries about the potential for a new isolationism brought on by fiscal difficulties at home.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/04/world/04gates1_span/04gates1_span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 329, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/04/world/04gates1_span/04gates1_span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 329}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/04/world/04gates1_span/04gates1_span-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 757, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/04/world/04gates1_span/04gates1_span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/04/world/04gates1_span/04gates1_span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Won’t Become Isolationist, Gates Tells Worried Asian Leaders', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. Won’t Become Isolationist, Gates Tells Worried Asian Leaders', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, '