nver, younger voters are championing cuts in spending, while older ones want to retain the services they counted on for their retirement.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/04/us/politics/04elders.html', 'snippet': 'In a rapidly aging suburb of Denver, younger voters are championing cuts in spending, while older ones want to retain the services they counted on for their retirement.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LAKEWOOD, Colo. — Economic wreckage in America’s older population is easy to find in the ashes of recession. And when combined with the politics of a presidential election next year and talk in Congress of cuts to the system of health and economic support for retirees, the result could be volatile.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/04/us/JP-ELDERS-1/JP-ELDERS-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/04/us/JP-ELDERS-1/JP-ELDERS-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/04/us/JP-ELDERS-1/JP-ELDERS-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 669, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Between Young and Old, a Political Collision', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Between Young and Old, a Political Collision', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Denver (Colo)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Voting and Voters', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Age, Chronological', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicare', 