o reduce the risk of it occurring in the first place, providing a new option for women at high risk of getting the disease, researchers reported here on Saturday. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Drug Can Reduce Risk of Breast Cancer, Study Says', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Drug Offers a Safer Option in Preventing Breast Cancer, Researchers Say', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMERICAN SOCIETY OF CLINICAL ONCOLOGY', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Avastin (Drug)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ovarian Cancer', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Breast Cancer', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-04T16:18:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Health', 'subsection_name': 'Research', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Pollack', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pollack', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3d1daa06-8db1-59c2-906f-25cd381ba4da', 'word_count': 1083, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3d1daa06-8db1-59c2-906f-25cd381ba4da'}, {'abstract': 'Many Syrian protesters dedicated their defiance on Friday to a 13-year-old boy who was arrested and killed after a protest in April.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/04/video-of-syrian-protesters-marching-for-a-child/', 'snippet': 'Many Syrian protesters dedicated their defiance on Friday to a 13-year-old boy who was arrested and killed after a protest in April.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Updated | 4:03 p.m. On Saturday, after Syria’s government restored the Internet access it had cut off on F