ir first since 2009.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/05/sports/tennis/nadal-federer-renew-the-greatest-grand-slam-rivalry.html', 'snippet': 'Roger Federer and Rafael Nadal have met in more Grand Slam finals than any other two men, but their French Open matchup is their first since 2009.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — No two men have met in a Grand Slam final as often as Roger Federer and Rafael Nadal, but there were times that it seemed it might not happen again. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/05/sports/YMEN1/YMEN1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 295, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/05/sports/YMEN1/YMEN1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 295}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/05/sports/YMEN1/YMEN1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 503, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/05/sports/YMEN1/YMEN1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/05/sports/YMEN1/YMEN1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'After Two-Year Break, a Special Grand Slam Rivalry Is Renewed', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'After Two-Year Break, a Special Grand Slam Rivalry Is Renewed', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'French Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Federer, Roger', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'per