, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/05/technology/05pingArt/05pingArt-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Focusing on the Social, Minus the Media', 'kicker': 'Ping', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Focusing on the Social, Minus the Media', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Start-ups', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Networking (Internet)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-04T17:10:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'SundayBusiness', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jenna Wortham', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jenna', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wortham', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2c5b0414-58fe-5a3d-b65a-ef735dfa5ad7', 'word_count': 1084, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2c5b0414-58fe-5a3d-b65a-ef735dfa5ad7'}, {'abstract': 'The market still hasn’t figured out a good way to dispel myths and sell the advantages of annuities for retirement investing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/05/business/economy/05view.html', 'snippet': 'The market still hasn’t figured out a good way to dispel myths and sell the advantages of annuities for retirement investing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IMAGINE a set of 65-year-old identical twins who plan to retire this summer after long careers. We’ll call them Dave and Ron. They have worked for different employers and have accumulated retirement benefits worth the same amount in dollars, but the benefits won’t be paid out the same way.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None,