/sports/baseball/a-magnificent-seven-of-pitchers-have-thwarted-jeter-more-than-most.html', 'snippet': 'Pitching to Derek Jeter at least eight times in the regular season, there are seven pitchers who have never allowed a hit, doing their small part to delay history.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ANAHEIM, Calif. — The list of pitchers includes an up-and-coming starter and a down-and-out reliever, a begoggled right-hander and a nearsighted left-hander. One is from Canada and one plays there now. The final one played for nine teams, three of them twice, over 19 seasons.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/05/sports/YJETERSILHO/YJETERSILHO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 690, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/05/sports/YJETERSILHO/YJETERSILHO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/05/sports/YJETERSILHO/YJETERSILHO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Magnificent Seven of Pitchers Have Thwarted Jeter', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Confounding Jeter', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Julio, Jorge', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zimmerman, Jeff', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Weathers, David', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Porcello, Rick', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jeter, Derek', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}],