': 'With May’s disappointing job numbers out, the talk shows are focusing on the economy.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/04/sunday-breakfast-menu-june-5/', 'snippet': 'With May’s disappointing job numbers out, the talk shows are focusing on the economy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Following the revelation of May’s disappointing job numbers, the Sunday shows are almost single-mindedly focused on the economy this week. The White House is sending Austan Goolsbee, chairman of President Obama’s Council of Economic Advisers, to be its representative in the discussion on ABC’s “This Week” and CNN’s “State of the Union.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Sunday Breakfast Menu, June 5', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-06-05T00:48:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Emmarie Huetteman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Emmarie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Huetteman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/194d0751-9184-57fd-8423-85a7055969c5', 'word_count': 473, 'uri': 'nyt://article/194d0751-9184-57fd-8423-85a7055969c5'}, {'abstract': 'Programs already plagued by delays and poor participation were not designed to fully address unemployment, now the primary cause of foreclosures.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/05/business/economy/05housing.html', 'snippet': 'Programs already plagued by delays and poor participation were not designed to fully address unemployment, now the primary cause of foreclosures.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Obama administration’s main program to keep distressed homeowners from falling into foreclosure has been aimed at those who took out subprime loans or other risky mortgages during the heady days of the housing boom. But these days, the primary cause of foreclosures is unemployment. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/05/us/SUB-HOUSING/SUB-HOUSING-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 345, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/05/us/SUB-HOUSING/SUB-HOUSING-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 345}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/05/us/SUB-HOUSING/SUB-HOUSING-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 727, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/05/us/SUB-HOUSING/SUB-HOUSING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/05/us/SUB-HOUSING/SUB-HOUSING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'For the Jobless, Little U.S. Help on Foreclosure', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Foreclosure Aid For the Jobless Is Falling Short', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homeowner Affordability and Stability Plan', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Unemployment', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Foreclosures', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mortgages', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-05T00:57:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Busin