 that they would lower prices in the world’s poorest countries.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/07/health/07global.html', 'snippet': 'Several makers of children’s vaccines announced Monday that they would lower prices in the world’s poorest countries.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Several makers of children’s vaccines announced Monday that they would lower prices in the world’s poorest countries, a move that could save donors billions of dollars and help bring the vaccines to more children (above, a polio vaccination in Congo).', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/07/health/07globalspan/07globalspan-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/07/health/07globalspan/07globalspan-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/07/health/07globalspan/07globalspan-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/07/health/07globalspan/07globalspan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/07/health/07globalspan/07globalspan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Drugs: Steep Vaccine Price Reductions Could Help in Reaching More Children', 'kicker': 'Global Update', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'DRUGS: Steep Vaccine Price Reductions Could Help in Reaching More Children', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 1, 'ma