nd Assyrian dialects, unspoken for 2,000 years but preserved on clay tablets and in stone inscriptions deciphered over the last two centuries, has finally been completed by scholars at the University of Chicago.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/07/science/07assyrianspan/07assyrianspan-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/07/science/07assyrianspan/07assyrianspan-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/07/science/07assyrianspan/07assyrianspan-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 647, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/07/science/07assyrianspan/07assyrianspan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/07/science/07assyrianspan/07assyrianspan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'After 90 Years, a Dictionary of an Ancient World', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'After 90 Years, a Dictionary of an Ancient World', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARCHAEOLOGY AND ANTHROPOLOGY', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Babylonia', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Language and Languages', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Chicago', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dictionaries', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-06T20:35:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Science', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Noble Wilford', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': 'Noble', 'lastname': 'Wilford', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9eb229a0-a502-55a7-98ff-d65618841266', 'word_count': 866, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9eb229a0-a502-55a7-98ff-d65618841266'}, {'abstract': 'The new Fiat 500 Sport, a snub-nosed little roadster, proves to be surprisingly spacious and stylish.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/06/artifacts-happiness-on-wheels/', 'snippet': 'The new Fiat 500 Sport, a snub-nosed little roadster, proves to be surprisingly spacious and stylish.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Driving makes me happy, especially in the summer. It isn’t just the lure of the open road. It’s also having wheels to get around a night of art openings in New York in the style they (and I) demand. That’s not an easy get.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Artifacts | Happiness on Wheels', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-06-06T20:45:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Linda Yablonsky', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Linda', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Yablonsky', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1e552966-596f-544b-b19f-6fd16d6fcce6', 'word_count': 742, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1e552966-596f-544b-b19f-6fd16d6fcce6'}, {'abstract': 'Frozen steaks and other compact cuts can be defrosted in as little as 10 minutes, without compromising their quality, and with very little effort.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/08/dining/a-hot-water-bath-for-thawing-meats-the-curious-cook.html', 'snippet': 'Frozen steaks and other compact cuts can be defrosted in as little as 10 minutes, without compromising their quality, and with very little effort.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EVEN in kitchens where fresh is king, the freezer remains a handy tool. There’s no easier way to deal with a bounty of meat from a big-box store or a butchering class or a C.S.A. share, or the haul from a fishing trip, or the unpredictable sighting of partridge and other rare birds in the Chinese market. In my house, the freezer is essential for drawing out the enjoyment of the prime mail-order meats that my mother sends for my birthday, and that arrive rock-hard under a block of dry ice.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/08/dining/08curious/Curious-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 770, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/08/dining/08curious/Curious-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/08/dining/08curious/Curious-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Hot-Water Bath for Thawing Meats', 'kicker': 'The Curious Cook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Hot-Water Bath For Thawing Meats', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Meat', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-06T20:53:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Harold McGee', 'person': [{'fir