. On Monday, Animal Kingdom turned in sharp work that suggested his best race may come Saturday in the 143rd running of the Belmont Stakes.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/07/sports/RACING/RACING-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 737, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/07/sports/RACING/RACING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/07/sports/RACING/RACING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Animal Kingdom Primed for Rematch at Belmont', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Animal Kingdom Primed For Rematch at Belmont', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Triple Crown (Horse Racing)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Horse Racing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Belmont Stakes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-07T00:42:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joe Drape', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joe', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Drape', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/19e464c7-3764-56ab-a5fa-9492dcfc60ba', 'word_count': 708, 'uri': 'nyt://article/19e464c7-3764-56ab-a5fa-9492dcfc60ba'}, {'abstract': 'Spending 45 minutes talking about your propensity for sex virtual and telephonic with women of uncertain ages tends to define an extinction-level event for most politicians.', 'web_url': 'http