l-bleeding-cornhusker-red.html', 'snippet': 'After a 14-year career in the major leagues, Darin Erstad has been named the baseball coach at Nebraska, his alma mater.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Darin Erstad was the first player chosen in the 1995 baseball draft, a two-sport star at Nebraska who reached the majors less than a year after signing with the California Angels. Yet Erstad approached the game with the desperation of an overachiever at a tryout camp. He hid wondrous athleticism beneath an unsmiling drive that belied his gilded status.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/07/sports/KEPNER/KEPNER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/07/sports/KEPNER/KEPNER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/07/sports/KEPNER/KEPNER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 584, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/07/sports/KEPNER/KEPNER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/07/sports/KEPNER/KEPNER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Erstad, Still Bleeding Cornhusker Red', 'kicker': 'On Baseball', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Erstad Still Bleeding Cornhusker Red', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Draft and Recruitment (Sports)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Erstad, Darin', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'College 