ted New York politician with many admirers on the left, but few close allies, he suddenly finds himself alone on a hostile stage.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/06/nyregion/06weiner5/06weiner5-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/06/nyregion/06weiner5/06weiner5-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/06/nyregion/06weiner5/06weiner5-jumbo-v4.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/06/nyregion/06weiner5/06weiner5-thumbStandard-v6.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/06/nyregion/06weiner5/06weiner5-thumbStandard-v6.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Democrats Shy From Weiner as G.O.P. Seizes on Scandal', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For Weiner, Few Allies, Even Among Democrats', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ethics (Institutional)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Twitter', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Weiner, Anthony D', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-07T04:25:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro