he possible disclosure of tens of millions of customers’ personal information.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'From Sony, an Apology and Then a New PlayStation Device', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-06-07T14:29:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Seth Schiesel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Seth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schiesel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ca51b745-012a-517f-9851-e4278f5d3db0', 'word_count': 426, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ca51b745-012a-517f-9851-e4278f5d3db0'}, {'abstract': 'NBC Sports, on its home network and on Versus, will provide six hours of coverage of the Belmont Stakes and events leading up to it on Friday and Saturday.', 'web_url': 'https://therail.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/07/belmont-stakes-television-coverage/', 'snippet': 'NBC Sports, on its home network and on Versus, will provide six hours of coverage of the Belmont Stakes and events leading up to it on Friday and Saturday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NBC Sports, on its home network and on Versus, will provide six hours of coverage of the Belmont Stakes and events leading up to it on Friday and Saturday. The draw will be televised on MSG and streamed live on BelmontStakes.com from 11 a.m. to 11:30 a.m. on Wednesday. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Belmont Stakes TV Coverage', 'kicker': 'The Rail', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Belmont Stakes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-07T14:30:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'origin