delivering in the clutch, Nowitzki just took a one-game lead.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/09/sports/2011-nba-finals-james-drops-off-as-nowitzki-rises.html', 'snippet': 'For N.B.A. fans keeping track of Dirk Nowitzki and LeBron James delivering in the clutch, Nowitzki just took a one-game lead.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For all of their obvious differences, Dirk Nowitzki and LeBron James share a common burden: the idea that for all of their prodigious talent, they hadn’t delivered in the biggest moments, that their lack of an N.B.A. championship reflected some sort of character flaw. With James, it was possible even to extrapolate that he knew this, and it’s why he joined a team of stars in Miami instead of insisting a champion be built around him in Cleveland.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'When It Counts', 'kicker': 'Leading Off', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'When It Counts', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ohio State University', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nowitzki, Dirk', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Hockey League', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Boston Bruins', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Vancouver Canucks', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Dallas Mavericks', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Miami Heat', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'James, LeBron', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Woods, Tiger', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Costas, Bob', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-08T15:57:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 