cle/885bc0f2-709d-5734-b2cf-664096b937a4'}, {'abstract': 'T spoke with Perez about her efforts to improve arts education in New York City schools.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/08/rosie-perezs-prom-night/', 'snippet': 'T spoke with Perez about her efforts to improve arts education in New York City schools.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s hard to believe, but the Oscar-nominated actress Rosie Perez (“Do the Right Thing,” “Pineapple Express”) wasn’t always the sassy, silver-tongued woman we’ve come to recognize. “I had such a bad speech impediment as a result of the emotional trauma I was going through in my life,” Perez says. “I couldn’t even say my name correctly. I would say, “Wosie Pewez.” But when Perez’s fifth grade teacher, Mr. Mackey, asked her to sing one of her favorite Jackson 5 songs, she discovered the impediment disappeared. “It changed me,” she says.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Rosie Perez’s Prom Night', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-06-08T16:45:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam Baran', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Baran', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/47451f76-beaf-5eec-ad2a-4e0d60afe5fe', 'word_count': 1401, 'uri': 'nyt://article/47451f76-beaf-5eec-ad2a-4e0d60afe5fe'}, {'abstract': 'President Obama visits a community college to talk about training people for jobs in manufacturing.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/08/obama-talks-up-job-training/', 'snippet': 'President Obama visits a community college to talk about training people for jobs in manufacturing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Obama went to a