ed his skill for organizing big parties into a fund-raising machine for a number of causes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IT was a sunny, warm Memorial Day weekend in Fire Island Pines, and Josh Wood sat in his seaside garden, laptop open and phone to his ear. A fountain burbled in the ornamental pond. The roses were in bloom. Led Zeppelin played over outdoor speakers.', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/09/fashion/Z-UP-CLOSE/Z-UP-CLOSE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/09/fashion/Z-UP-CLOSE/Z-UP-CLOSE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/09/fashion/Z-UP-CLOSE/Z-UP-CLOSE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1023, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/09/fashion/Z-UP-CLOSE/Z-UP-CLOSE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/09/fashion/Z-UP-CLOSE/Z-UP-CLOSE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Cause With Every Party', 'kicker': 'Up Close', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Cause With Every Party', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'NIGHTCLUBS AND CABARETS', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parties (Social)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Philanthropy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-08T18:43:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'bylin