nippet': 'Relief pitcher Joba Chamberlain has a strained flexor muscle in his right elbow.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Tuesday, Manager Joe Girardi watched Mark Teixeira writhe in such pain after being struck by a pitch that he thought Teixeira broke his right kneecap. On Wednesday, Teixeira seemed one of the healthier players in the Yankees’ clubhouse.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Yankees Put Chamberlain on D.L. With Elbow Injury', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chamberlain, Joba', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-08T20:25:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Shpigel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shpigel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/884cd6d7-3b09-52a3-a720-0ff87f95ad70', 'word_count': 910, 'uri': 'nyt://article/884cd6d7-3b09-52a3-a720-0ff87f95ad70'}, {'abstract': 'A no-longer youthful shopper seeks Jude Law perfection on a Weber Grill-like body.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/09/fashion/seeking-to-be-jude-law-in-a-swimsuit.html', 'snippet': 'A no-longer youthful shopper seeks Jude Law perfection on a Weber Grill-like body.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IN its Platonic ideal, a bathing suit removes you momentarily from yourself, and perhaps unleashes heretofore dormant aspects of your personality. Wriggle into a great-looking suit that’s black and snug and tailored, and suddenly you’re ready for an underwater cocktail party; rock a pair of floral Hawaiian board shorts and su