 the NATO alliance that “there will be no rush to the exits.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/10/world/asia/10gates.html', 'snippet': 'As the Obama administration considers its plan to withdraw extra combat forces from Afghanistan, Defense Secretary Robert M. Gates assured the NATO alliance that “there will be no rush to the exits.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'BRUSSELS — As the Obama administration moves toward a decision on how rapidly to withdraw its extra combat forces from Afghanistan, Defense Secretary Robert M. Gates assured the NATO alliance on Thursday that “there will be no rush to the exits.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/10/world/10gates/10gates-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 687, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/10/world/10gates/10gates-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/10/world/10gates/10gates-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Gates Vows ‘No Rush to the Exits’ in Afghanistan', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Gates Vows ‘No Rush to the Exits’ in Afghanistan', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Taliban', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'North Atlantic Treaty Organization', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Defense Department', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gates, Robert M', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '20