ping-reyes-would-give-mets-fans-hope.html', 'snippet': 'A bold move by ownership is needed in these troubled times, and Jose Reyes has crystallized into the player the franchise always envisioned.', 'lead_paragraph': 'By all accounts, David Einhorn excels at hedge funds and poker, which may actually be the same thing. It is now time for the prospective part owner of the Mets to demonstrate a third talent: channeling his inner Nelson Doubleday and bludgeoning his new business chums into doing the right thing. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/10/sports/VECSEY1/VECSEY1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 375, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/10/sports/VECSEY1/VECSEY1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 375}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/10/sports/VECSEY1/VECSEY1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 833, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/10/sports/VECSEY1/VECSEY1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/10/sports/VECSEY1/VECSEY1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Message to Einhorn: It’s Time to Pay Reyes', 'kicker': 'Sports of The Times', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Message To Einhorn: Pay Reyes', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Reyes, Jose', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Einhorn, David', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 3, 'maj