 executive of the J. Paul Getty Trust in Los Angeles.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/10/arts/VOGEL/VOGEL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 925, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Now Starring in Chicago, a Prime Rauschenberg', 'kicker': 'Inside Art', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Now Starring in Chicago, a Prime Rauschenberg', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rauschenberg, Robert', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ART INSTITUTE OF CHICAGO', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Museum of Modern Art', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-09T20:38:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Carol Vogel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Carol', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vogel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4317971e-f098-571c-a105-a4f7d31d817b', 'word_count': 1110, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4317971e-f098-571c-a105-a4f7d31d817b'}, {'abstract': 'A selected guide to jazz performances in New York.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/10/arts/music/jazz-listings-for-june-10-16.html', 'snippet': 'A selected guide to jazz performances in New York.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jazz', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jazz Listings for June 10-16', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Jazz', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': '