 among the crossover, genre-blurring slurry...', 'lead_paragraph': ' MANCHESTER, Tenn. — I haven’t been to Bonnaroo in a while — since the second festival, in 2003. The tenth edition starts Thursday, and runs through Sunday. Looking at this year’s schedule, I remembered that one of the festival’s organizers, Ashley Capps, told me eight years ago that he wanted to book Eminem. It sounded a little like a back then joke. Eminem is playing here this year, though, headlining on Saturday night.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bonnaroo: Returning to a Festival Much Changed', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bonnaroo Festival (Manchester, Tenn)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Capps, Ashley', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Eminem', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'James, Jim (1978- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jay-Z', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Young, Neil', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Grateful Dead', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kylesa (Music Group)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Metallica', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'My Morning Jacket', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Opeth (Music Group)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Preservation Hall Jazz Band', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sonic Youth', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Tennessee', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-10T01:22:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Ratliff', 'person': [{