essee Williams, who specialized in angels in exile, Ollie first appeared in a 1944 short story. But he is only now making his New York debut, on the stage of the Acorn Theater on West 42nd Street.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/10/arts/ONEARM/ONEARM-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/10/arts/ONEARM/ONEARM-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/10/arts/ONEARM/ONEARM-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 714, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/10/arts/ONEARM/ONEARM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/10/arts/ONEARM/ONEARM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Hustler on the Streets, Missing Both a Limb and a Capacity to Feel', 'kicker': "Theater Review | 'One Arm'", 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Hustler on the Streets, Missing Both a Limb And a Capacity to Feel', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kaufman, Moises', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McLane, Derek', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, Tennessee', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Tectonic Theater Project', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New Group Theater Co', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '201