or has stated his opposition to a federally-mandated health insurance exchange, the Department of Insurance is busily making plans for one.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/10/us/10ttinsurance.html', 'snippet': 'While the governor has stated his opposition to a federally-mandated health insurance exchange, the Department of Insurance is busily making plans for one.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gov. Rick Perry has made no secret of his disdain for federal health reform or for one of its key tenets, a Travelocity-like state insurance marketplace in which consumers could choose from public and private health plans.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Behind the Scenes, Plans for Insurance Exchange', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Behind the Scenes, Plans For Insurance Exchange', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Perry, Rick', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Texas', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-10T02:42:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Emily Ramshaw', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Emily', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ramshaw', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a2c87c0b-8f82-5a3b-b9d7-aedf33eca142', 'word_count': 601, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a2c87c0b-8f82-5a3b-b9d7-aedf33eca142'}, {'abstract': 'It’s only early June, but already trouble has arisen at some Chicago beaches, an unfortunate coincidence on the 50th anniversary of the campaign to integrate the beaches.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/10/us/10cncbeaches.html', 'snippet': 'It’s only early June, but already trouble has arisen at some Chicago beaches, an unfortunate coincidence on the 50th anniversary of the campaign to integrate the beaches.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A sun-kissed army of teenagers and 20-somethings preen in flip-flops and strut their way down the jam-packed path at North Avenue Beach on a hot Saturday afternoon. There’s music blasting and plenty of boozing, volleyball and eye candy for almost every taste. This isn’t just a beach. It’s a single’s bar with sand.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/10/us/10CNCBEACHES1/10CNCBEACHES1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 651, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/10/us/10CNCBEACHES1/10CNCBEACHES1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/10/us/10CNCBEACHES1/10CNCBEACHES1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sun and Sand Attract Crowds, and Also Trouble', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sun and Sand Attract Crowds, And Also Trouble', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chicago (Ill)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crime and Criminals', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Beaches', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Race and Ethnicity', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-10T02:49:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Don Terry', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Don', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Terry', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'repor