le are ready for whatever. They’ll take whatever.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bonnaroo: Getting a Feel for the Early Crowd', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bonnaroo Festival (Manchester, Tenn)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Festivals', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Glover, Donald', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Deerhunter (Music Group)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Tennessee', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-10T06:49:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Ratliff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ratliff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/df495313-e962-5cf0-8dcb-6356e2a331fa', 'word_count': 216, 'uri': 'nyt://article/df495313-e962-5cf0-8dcb-6356e2a331fa'}, {'abstract': 'Can you correctly answer this question about the Balkan wars of the 1990s?', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/10/test-yourself-history-june-10-2011/', 'snippet': 'Can you correctly answer this question about the Balkan wars of the 1990s?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Test your knowledge of history with today’s question about the conflict in the Balkans in the 1990s.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Test Yourself | History, June 10, 2011', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-06-10T07:19:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Learn