ble with large sums of cash” sounded easy enough — and applied.', 'web_url': 'https://therail.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/10/the-view-from-behind-the-betting-windows/', 'snippet': 'The summer after I graduated from high school, I needed a job. The track was hiring  — the track was always hiring. I wanted to be an usher, or sell admission tickets, but all of those spots were taken, and since I knew I’d be a terrible security ...', 'lead_paragraph': 'Elizabeth Minkel started taking bets at Saratoga in 2003. She still moonlights as a parimutuel clerk, but she spends most of her time working as a production editor and books blogger for The New Yorker.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The View From Behind the Betting Windows', 'kicker': 'The Rail', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Horse Racing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Saratoga Springs (NY)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-10T15:00:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elizabeth Minkel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elizabeth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Minkel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3e81dde6-57ba-5fd0-ae2d-4b34f709bc28', 'word_count': 873, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3e81dde6-57ba-5fd0-ae2d-4b34f709bc28'}, {'abstract': 'LeBron James needs to win the N.B.A. title to spare himself from enduring the daily dissection and public pressure all over again.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/11/sports/basketball/questions-will-hound-lebron-james-until-he-wins-that-title.html', 'snippet': 'LeBron James needs to win the N.B.A. title to spare himself from enduring the daily dissection and public pressure all over again.', 'lead_paragr