ed residents. While the ambience at these restaurants might be buzzing, the food doesn’t necessarily impress. The upscale Italian boîte Two One Two Bar and Grill, which opened just over a year ago, is different: although the glamour set has already descended here, the draw is decidedly on the menu.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Restaurant Report: Two One Two Bar and Grill in Mumbai', 'kicker': 'Bites ', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mumbai: Two One Two Bar and Grill', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mumbai (India)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-10T18:55:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Shivani Vora', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Shivani', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vora', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2094b7d2-1ea3-501f-98d4-eeac107ffe49', 'word_count': 404, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2094b7d2-1ea3-501f-98d4-eeac107ffe49'}, {'abstract': 'In the heart of Hollywood, a hotel’s vintage-meets-bohemian style makes a stay feel more like rooming at a friend’s.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/12/travel/the-redbury-in-los-angeles-check-incheck-out.html', 'snippet': 'In the heart of Hollywood, a hotel’s vintage-meets-bohemian style makes a stay feel more like rooming at a friend’s.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE UPSHOT', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/12/travel/12-CHECKIN/12-CHECKIN-jumb