To eat in and around Seattle, isn’t merely to eat well. It is to experience an exhilarating sense of place.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To eat in and around Seattle, isn’t merely to eat well. It is to experience an exhilarating sense of place.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/12/travel/20110612-seattle-slide-4CID/20110612-seattle-slide-4CID-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/12/travel/20110612-seattle-slide-4CID/20110612-seattle-slide-4CID-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/12/travel/20110612-seattle-slide-4CID/20110612-seattle-slide-4CID-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Fork by Northwest', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Seattle (Wash)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'San Juan Islands (Wash)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-10T18:55:28+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Slideshow', '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/eb24aa6d-a4dd-52fc-952a-8413575ee464', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/eb24aa6d-a4dd-52fc-952a-8413575ee464'}, {'abstract': 'If you go to Greece and avoid Athens and the popular islands, there are a lot of other lovely places to visit on the mainland that will remind people of what the islands were like 30 years ago.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/12/travel/letters-off-season-summer.html', 'snippet': 'If you go to Greece and avoid Athens and the popular islands, there are a lot of other lovely places to visit on the mainland that will remind people of what the islands were like 30 years ago.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To the Editor: Re “Traveling Off-Season, in Summer” (Practical Traveler, May 29): If you go to Greece and avoid Athens and the popular islands, there are a lot of other lovely places to visit on the mainland that will remind people of what the islands were like 30 years ago. The less popular islands are also great. Small hotels can be very affordable and quite nice. You could easily spend $100 or less a day for off-the-beaten-path but still nice lodgings. Spend a little more and it would be even nicer, with hardly any company. Joseph Coates', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Letters: Off-Season Summer', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Letters: Off-Season Summer', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-06-10T18:55:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Letter', '_id': 'nyt://article/4b795273-3371-5694-8976-4578045dd924', 'word_count': 173, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4b795273-3371-5694-8976-4578045dd924'}, {'abstract': 'New CDs by Aaron Goldberg and Guillermo Klein, BB&C, Woods, Diskjokke and Youssou N’Dour.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/12/arts/music/new-cds-by-bbc-woods-diskjokke-and-youssou-ndour.html', 'snippet': 'New CDs by Aaron Goldberg and Guillermo Klein, BB&C, Woods, Diskjokke and Youssou N’Dour.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Aaron Goldberg and Guillermo Klein', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, '