awa Senators of the National Hockey League.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/10/big-ticket-sold-for-12000000/', 'snippet': 'A four-bedroom apartment with 4,800 square feet of space was sold by Eugene Melnyk, the owner of the Ottawa Senators of the National Hockey League.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A four-bedroom four-and-a-half-bathroom condominium in the Park Millennium on West 67th Street that closed for $12 million was the highest sale of the week, according to Streeteasy.com and brokers with knowledge of the final sale price.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Big Ticket | Sold for $12,000,000', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Housing and Real Estate', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-10T19:39:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sarah Kershaw', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sarah', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kershaw', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/89a5365e-7481-5cbe-9b10-2e9822b56cda', 'word_count': 116, 'uri': 'nyt://article/89a5365e-7481-5cbe-9b10-2e9822b56cda'}, {'abstract': 'With her company’s mineral-based products, Leslie Blodgett has changed how women approach makeup, and inspired a loyal following.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/12/fashion/leslie-blodgett-of-bare-escentuals-the-queen-of-beauty.html', 'snippet': 'With her company’s mineral-based products, Leslie Blodgett has changed how women approach makeup, and inspired a loyal following.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN FRANCISCO', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'ur