f not most weekdays, A. Rey Pamatmat follows the same routine: Wake at 5 a.m., then two hours of ashtanga yoga followed by two hours of playwriting, before heading from Jackson Heights, Queens, to the East Village and his day job as a database manager at the Public Theater. He usually hits the sack at 10 p.m. — a lifestyle with which he has no complaints, he said, other than one: He has craved more time for writing.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quit Your Day Job? Winner of Lark Playwriting Fellowship Will Do Just That', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Playwright Gets Chance To Quit His Day Job', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Scholarships and Fellowships', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Writing and Writers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Berry, Justin', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kopit, Arthur', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pamatmat, A Rey', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rebeck, Theresa', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ruhl, Sarah', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Smith, Tommy', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wright, Doug (1962- )', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Lark Play Development Center', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Public Theater', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'East Village (NYC)', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Jackson Heights (NYC)', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Queens (NYC)', 'rank': 15, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-10T20:03:11+0000', 'document_type': 'articl