ord_count': 575, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b884448c-d2c8-573f-8e59-4cbbf904045c'}, {'abstract': 'Andre Agassi talked about his life after tennis, including his work building charter schools and the reaction to his recent book.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/12/sports/tennis/andre-agassi-discusses-his-post-tennis-career.html', 'snippet': 'Andre Agassi talked about his life after tennis, including his work building charter schools and the reaction to his recent book.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — Andre Agassi has retired from tennis, but is hardly retired from the work force. At 41, he has announced his goal, in conjunction with a Los Angeles-based investment firm, to finance the construction of as many as 75 charter schools in the United States in the next several years.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/12/sports/SUB-Y-AGASSI/SUB-Y-AGASSI-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/12/sports/SUB-Y-AGASSI/SUB-Y-AGASSI-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/12/sports/SUB-Y-AGASSI/SUB-Y-AGASSI-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 719, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/12/sports/SUB-Y-AGASSI/SUB-Y-AGASSI-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/12/sports/SUB-Y-AGASSI/SUB-Y-AGASSI-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Agassi’s Post-Tennis Career Is Anything but Restful', 'kicker': 'Straight Sets', 'content_k