 continued to burn on Saturday. Officials were bracing for high winds, projected to pick up in the afternoon, that would test the containment efforts after a two-day reprieve from harsh weather.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Video Shows Efforts to Contain Arizona Blaze', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Forest and Brush Fires', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Forest Service', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ARIZONA', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-11T20:01:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elizabeth A. Harris', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elizabeth', 'middlename': 'A.', 'lastname': 'Harris', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b0f704cc-680d-5a5b-a865-7ad0113e571e', 'word_count': 297, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b0f704cc-680d-5a5b-a865-7ad0113e571e'}, {'abstract': 'Mark Jackson is an ABC analyst for the N.B.A. finals and the coach of the Golden State Warriors. Can one man do that? Should he?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/12/sports/revolving-door-is-not-an-open-and-shut-case.html', 'snippet': 'Mark Jackson is an ABC analyst for the N.B.A. finals and the coach of the Golden State Warriors. Can one man do that? Should he?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Does this look right? Mark Jackson is an ABC analyst for the N.B.A. finals and the coach of the Golden State Warriors. Can one man do that? Should he? Shouldn’t there be a panel of wise men to decide this?', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/0