'lead_paragraph': 'PITTSBURGH — Mets Manager Terry Collins made four possible lineups for Saturday night’s game against the Pirates, including one that had Jason Bay batting second and another with Daniel Murphy there. Instead, he chose Ruben Tejada, the 21-year-old infielder who went into the game hitting .329.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mets Move Hot-Hitting Tejada to No. 2 in the Order', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Collins, Terry L', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tejada, Ruben', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pittsburgh Pirates', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-11T23:38:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Waldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Waldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8fb5511a-2cbe-588e-9a14-9266936efd03', 'word_count': 303, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8fb5511a-2cbe-588e-9a14-9266936efd03'}, {'abstract': 'When the beloved rock formation in New Hampshire crumbled in 2003, it crushed the heart of a state.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/12/us/12memorial.html', 'snippet': 'When the beloved rock formation in New Hampshire crumbled in 2003, it crushed the heart of a state.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FRANCONIA, N.H. — There is no replacing the Old Man of the Mountain, the beloved natural landmark that tumbled from its craggy perch at Franconia Notch State Park in 2003, sending this state into deepes