wly selected first-round draft pick of the Boston Red Sox, to face the defending national champion South Carolina on Saturday in the Columbia Super Regional of the N.C.A.A. tournament.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/12/sports/cws/cws-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 854, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/12/sports/cws/cws-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/12/sports/cws/cws-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'South Carolina Prevails, Putting UConn Under Familiar N.C.A.A. Pressure', 'kicker': 'Roundup', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'South Carolina Prevails, Putting Connecticut in Familiar N.C.A.A. Peril', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of South Carolina', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'College Athletics', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Connecticut', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'College World Series', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Virginia', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'NCAA Baseball Championships', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-12T00:16:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Viv Bernstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Viv', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bernstein', 'qualifier': 