ashington-based prostitution service, did not resign his seat. In fact, Mr. Vitter won re-election with 56.6 percent of the vote last November.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Electoral Effect of Sex Scandals', 'kicker': 'FiveThirtyEight', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vitter, David', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Weiner, Anthony D', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-12T00:27:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nate Silver', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Silver', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8599a77b-54b2-5a72-9200-47571e85b179', 'word_count': 497, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8599a77b-54b2-5a72-9200-47571e85b179'}, {'abstract': 'Tyson Gay and his training partner, Steve Mullings of Jamaica, both finished in 10.26 seconds, but a closer look revealed Mullings had crossed the line just ahead of Gay.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/12/sports/gay-loses-mens-100-after-a-photo-finish.html', 'snippet': 'Tyson Gay and his training partner, Steve Mullings of Jamaica, both finished in 10.26 seconds, but a closer look revealed Mullings had crossed the line just ahead of Gay.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With the temperature a nudge above 60 and a relentless rain dampening the afternoon, the conditions were not ideal for sprinters Saturday at the Adidas Grand Prix meet at Icahn Stadium on Randalls Island. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'At Adidas Grand Prix, Gay Loses Men’s 100 Meters in a Photo Finish', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'At Adidas Grand Prix, Gay Loses Men’s 100 Meters in a Photo Finish', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Track and Field', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mullings, Steve', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gay, Tyson', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ADIDAS AG', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-12T00:32:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jorge Castillo', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jorge', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Castillo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3582bb03-0c9e-5a8b-a720-a3b5d82a9111', 'word_count': 889, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3582bb03-0c9e-5a8b-a720-a3b5d82a9111'}, {'abstract': 'With a late push down the stretch, Ruler on Ice, ridden by Jose Valdivia Jr., held off Stay Thirsty to win the 143rd running of the Belmont Stakes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/12/sports/ruler-on-ice-a-long-shot-wins-at-muddy-belmont.html', 'snippet': 'With a late push down the stretch, Ruler on Ice, ridden by Jose Valdivia Jr., held off Stay Thirsty to win the 143rd running of the Belmont Stakes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Why in a Triple Crown season dominated by fresh faces and improbable long shots would the 143rd running of the Belmont Stakes be any different? Why wouldn’t the racing gods give horseplayers and horse lovers alike one more bank-busting bomber in the winner’s circle of the mile-and-a-half Test of the Champion and introduce another unlikely set of Triple Crown first-timers?', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The Ne