ounding victories, sending Cleveland to its 14th loss in 18 games.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There was no meeting, no pep talk, no nothing after the Yankees were embarrassed by Boston last week. “Report at 4 o’clock the next day, that was it,” Curtis Granderson said. Every series has its own pace, its own rhythm. And at Yankee Stadium the thump-thump-thump of the Red Sox has given way to the off-key stylings of the Cleveland Indians.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/13/sports/baseball/13yankeespix/13yankeespix-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/13/sports/baseball/13yankeespix/13yankeespix-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/13/sports/baseball/13yankeespix/13yankeespix-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/13/sports/baseball/13yankeespix/13yankeespix-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/13/sports/baseball/13yankeespix/13yankeespix-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'With 18 Hits, the Yankees Are Humming Again', 'kicker': 'Yankees 9, Indians 1', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'With 18 Hits, the Yankees Are Humming Again', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Granderson, Curtis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cleveland Indians', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'va