trong, but its 8-1 loss to the Yankees on Sunday was its 14th in 18 games since May 23.', 'web_url': 'https://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/12/indians-hopeful-start-becomes-faded-memory/', 'snippet': 'Cleveland began the season surprisingly strong, but its 8-1 loss to the Yankees on Sunday was its 14th in 18 games since May 23.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After a disappointing start to the 2008 season, months removed from falling one game short of an American League pennant the previous October, the Cleveland Indians’ front office decided to blow up the roster midway through the campaign. The rebuilding process began with trading the aceC. C. Sabathia to the Milwaukee Brewers in 2008 and continued when the then-reigning A.L. Cy Young Award winner Cliff Lee was dealt to the Philadelphia Phillies the next season.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Indians’ Hopeful Start Becomes Faded Memory', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-06-13T00:37:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By JORGE CASTILLO', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jorge', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'CASTILLO', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9c5b5477-8e12-53c3-a4cc-443970a6fcad', 'word_count': 809, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9c5b5477-8e12-53c3-a4cc-443970a6fcad'}, {'abstract': 'In an effort to attract young male readers, Time is allowing Activision to use its cover format for a promotion for the newest Call of Duty video game.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/12/time-lends-cover-for-apocalyptic-image/', 'snippet': 'In an effort to attract young male readers, Time is allowing Activision to use its cover format for a promotion fo