/06/13/arts/claudio-bravo-artist-who-blended-hyperrealism-and-classical-elements-dies-at-74.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Bravo, who was born in Chile and lived in Morocco, was an established society portrait painter before he began depicting commonplace objects in the context of art history.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Claudio Bravo, a Chilean-born artist whose technically dazzling trompe-l’oeil paintings of paper-wrapped packages and draped cloth blended hyperrealism and classical Spanish influences , died on June 4 at his home in Taroudant, Morocco. He was 74.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/13/arts/BRAVO1-obit/BRAVO1-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 709, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/13/arts/BRAVO1-obit/BRAVO1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/13/arts/BRAVO1-obit/BRAVO1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Claudio Bravo, Chilean Artist, Dies at 74', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Claudio Bravo, Chilean Artist, Dies at 74', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bravo, Claudio', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-13T01:57:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Grimes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Grimes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/cb159617-f2e4-5c28-9959-734950853714', 'word_count': 724, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cb159617-f2e4-5c28-9959-734950853714'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Greenland, whose agency created head-turning campaigns for Johnnie Walker and Penthouse, was an advocate for truth in advertising.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/13/business/13greenland.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Greenland, whose agency created head-turning campaigns for Johnnie Walker and Penthouse, was an advocate for truth in advertising.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Leo Greenland, an advertising executive known for a string of evocative campaigns of the late 20th century and for public advocacy of truthfulness in his profession, a faintly subversive stance on Madison Avenue at midcentury, died on June 4 in Manhattan. He was 91.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/13/business/GEENLAND1-obit/GEENLAND1-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 698, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/13/business/GEENLAND1-obit/GEENLAND1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/13/business/GEENLAND1-obit/GEENLAND1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Leo Greenland, Unconventional Adman Who Valued Truth-Telling, Dies at 91', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Leo Greenland, Unconventional Adman Who Valued Truth-Telling, Dies at 91', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, 