1-06-13T12:07:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Science', 'subsection_name': 'Environment', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matthew L. Wald', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matthew', 'middlename': 'L.', 'lastname': 'Wald', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5aac605d-7115-5c51-9e35-461969be799b', 'word_count': 704, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5aac605d-7115-5c51-9e35-461969be799b'}, {'abstract': 'How to avoid credit card problems when traveling abroad, safeguarding your passwords, the new iTunes and other consumer-focused news from The New York Times.', 'web_url': 'https://bucks.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/13/monday-reading-how-to-avoid-credit-card-problems-abroad/', 'snippet': 'How to avoid credit card problems when traveling abroad, safeguarding your passwords, the new iTunes and other consumer-focused news from The New York Times.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A variety of consumer-focused articles appears daily in The New York Times and online in our blogs. Each weekday morning, we gather them together here so you can quickly scan the news that could hit you in your wallet.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Monday Reading: How to Avoid Credit Card Problems Abroad', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-06-13T12:22:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ann Carrns', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ann', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carrns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0bc0dfb3-ebac-5c1f-b878-269c8357a837', 'word_count': 183, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0bc0dfb3-ebac-5c1f-b878-269c8357a837'}, {'abstr