ians who no longer have contracts.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/13/fuller-and-blackwell-create-joint-venture-for-established-artists/', 'snippet': 'The partnership will look to broker deals for well-known musicians who no longer have contracts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The creator of “American Idol” and the record executive behind Bob Marley and U2 have started a joint venture to develop media and branding deals for superstar musicians who no longer have recording contracts. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Fuller and Blackwell Create Joint Venture for Established Artists', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Blackwell, Chris', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fuller, Simon', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Island Records', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Universal Music Group', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-13T15:05:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Sisario', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sisario', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/af15a903-c7d5-5041-8cbc-12b29266d206', 'word_count': 229, 'uri': 'nyt://article/af15a903-c7d5-5041-8cbc-12b29266d206'}, {'abstract': 'A house in upstate New York is among those threatened by an active year for excruciatingly slow landslides.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/14/nyregion/creeping-landslide-puts-ny-house-on-precipice.html', 'snippet': 'A house in upstate New York is among those threatened by an active year for excruciatingly slow landslides.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KEENE VALLEY, N.Y. — On May 6, the iris garden alongside Jim and Charity Marlatts’ house on a mountain two hours north of Albany was cleaved by a small crack only two inches wide. It was the start of a natural catastrophe, one that is still unfolding at an excruciatingly slow pace.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/14/nyregion/14Landslide_cnd/14Landslide_cnd-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/14/nyregion/14Landslide_cnd/14Landslide_cnd-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/14/nyregion/14Landslide_cnd/14Landslide_cnd-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/14/nyregion/14Landslide_cnd/14Landslide_cnd-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/14/nyregion/14Landslide_cnd/14Landslide_cnd-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'When Nature Destroys in Slow Motion', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Big Landslide In Adirondacks Inflicts Pain, Inch by Inch', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Landslides and Mudslides', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Housing and Real Estate', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-13T15:07:31+0000