e often make promises to ourselves about our financial behavior. Here’s how to make them really stick.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Carl Richards is a certified financial planner in Park City, Utah. His sketches are archived here on the Bucks blog and on his personal Web site, BehaviorGap.com.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Famous Last Words: No More Stocks Ever!', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Personal Finances', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-13T16:43:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Carl Richards', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Carl', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Richards', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/31d132b7-dd51-5b60-81c0-5fb049c4519b', 'word_count': 350, 'uri': 'nyt://article/31d132b7-dd51-5b60-81c0-5fb049c4519b'}, {'abstract': 'In his resort collection for Balenciaga, Nicolas Ghesquière turned the volume way up.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/13/just-one-look-balenciaga-resort-collection/', 'snippet': 'In his resort collection for Balenciaga, Nicolas Ghesquière turned the volume way up.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In his resort collection for Balenciaga, Nicolas Ghesquière turned the volume way up. Key pieces included a blouse with serious wingspan and a dramatically undulating “umbrella” skirt. Even the heel of the shoe had a provocative bulge. Resounding through the collection was a new print for the season that mixed a hand-painted brick motif adapted from the Balenciaga archive with a roughly drawn houndstooth pattern. Executed in scorching fuchsia, the cacophony was rather brilliant.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Just One Look | Balenciaga Resort Collection', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-06-13T17:00:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alix Browne', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alix', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Browne', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e0153b3c-704f-566d-b216-e34d40fe0470', 'word_count': 77, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e0153b3c-704f-566d-b216-e34d40fe0470'}, {'abstract': 'Ronald  Perelman’s MacAndrews & Forbes is offering to pay $24 a share in cash for the shares it does not already own.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2011/06/13/perelman-offers-to-buy-out-mf-worldwide/', 'snippet': 'Ronald  Perelman’s MacAndrews & Forbes is offering to pay $24 a share in cash for the shares it does not already own.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ronald O. Perelman‘s holding company, MacAndrews & Forbes Holdings, on Monday offered to buy out the rest of M&F Worldwide that it did not already own. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Perelman Offers to Buy Out M&F Worldwide', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Perelman, Ronald O', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-13T17:04:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dealbook', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dealbook', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0f739