en’t exotic but, rather, familiar places made interesting by the experiences and observations of the writers. With the design, we wanted to develop a visual language that subtly evoked Americana and also felt unique and personal, like the articles themselves. We looked at a variety of travel-related materials: everything from postcards to airline identities to airport-way-finding systems.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Type Matters', 'kicker': 'The 6th Floor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Typography', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-13T20:30:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gail Bichler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gail', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bichler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/43a746e1-d5e4-5f35-8a7c-ffed9276cadb', 'word_count': 219, 'uri': 'nyt://article/43a746e1-d5e4-5f35-8a7c-ffed9276cadb'}, {'abstract': 'Photographs from Afghanistan, Libya, Lebanon and New Zealand.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2011/06/13/blogs/20110613POD.html', 'snippet': 'Photographs from Afghanistan, Libya, Lebanon and New Zealand.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Photographs from Afghanistan, Libya, Lebanon and New Zealand.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/13/blogs/20110613POD-slide-QOBJ/20110613POD-slide-QOBJ-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 664, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Pictures of the Day: Afghanistan and Elsewhere', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords':