a8e8-22564e42f21b'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Gardner’s tenor voice was heard on hits like “Yakety Yak” and “Searchin.’ ”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/14/arts/music/carl-gardner-lead-singer-of-coasters-dies-at-83.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Gardner’s tenor voice was heard on hits like “Yakety Yak” and “Searchin.’ ”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Carl Gardner, the spunky tenor who was the lead singer of the original Coasters, whose mixture of rhythm-and-blues, doo-wop and sitcom humor created 1950s hits like “Yakety Yak,” “Charlie Brown” and “Searchin,’\xa0” died on Sunday in Port. St. Lucie, Fla. He was 83.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/14/arts/GARDNER-obit/GARDNER-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 546, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/14/arts/GARDNER-obit/GARDNER-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/14/arts/GARDNER-obit/GARDNER-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Carl Gardner, Singer With Coasters Pop Group, Dies at 83', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Carl Gardner, 83, Singer With Coasters Pop Group', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-14T03:02:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bruce Weber', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bruce', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weber', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/ae65b366-aaa2-501d-a39b-1ede27ccebe7', 'word_count': 551, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ae65b366-aaa2-501d-a39b-1ede27ccebe7'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Fischer added expressionistic depth to Bergman classics like “The Seventh Seal” and “Wild Strawberries.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/14/arts/gunnar-fischer-a-cinematographer-for-bergman-dies-at-100.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Fischer added expressionistic depth to Bergman classics like “The Seventh Seal” and “Wild Strawberries.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gunnar Fischer, a cinematographer whose use of stark lighting and sharp focus lent mood and psychological depth to a dozen of Ingmar Bergman’s early films, including “The Seventh Seal” and “Wild Strawberries,” died on Saturday in Stockholm. He was 100.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/15/arts/FISCHER1-obit/FISCHER1-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 921, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/15/arts/FISCHER1-obit/FISCHER1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/15/arts/FISCHER1-obit/FISCHER1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Gunnar Fischer, Cinematographer for Bergman, Dies at 100', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Gunnar Fischer, 100, Cinematographer', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'n