'byline': {'original': 'By Colin Moynihan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Colin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Moynihan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6cf5d5a6-65ac-56b7-a31a-00202d98518d', 'word_count': 480, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6cf5d5a6-65ac-56b7-a31a-00202d98518d'}, {'abstract': 'This season the house mixes their classic shapes and style with subtle yet popping prints.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/14/just-one-look-i-vera-wang-resort/', 'snippet': 'This season the house mixes their classic shapes and style with subtle yet popping prints.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Vera Wang does prints! “Resort 2012 is all about strong brights, counterbalanced by gentle geometrics and dots,” Wang says. This season the house mixes its classic shapes and style (utility vests and jackets, sporty draped skirts and voluminous blouses) with subtle yet popping prints like this red spotted cutout dress and sporty cropped pants.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Just One Look | Vera Wang Resort', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-06-14T18:22:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Chelsea Zalopany', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chelsea', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zalopany', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8b0773ab-c2a6-5915-ad4a-9821b007497a', 'word_count': 57, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8b0773ab-c2a6-5915-ad4a-9821b007497a'}, {'abstract': 'Anshu Jain, head of investment banking at Deutsche Bank, faces obstacles to succeeding Josef Ackermann as chief executive, but some say the bank risks losing him if it delays.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/15/business/global/15jain.html', 'snippet': 'Anshu Jain, head of investment banking at Deutsche Bank, faces obstacles to succeeding Josef Ackermann as chief executive, but some say the bank risks losing him if it delays.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Hanging on the wall of Anshu Jain’s office, where he runs Deutsche Bank’s worldwide investment banking operations, is a picture of Mr. Jain’s former boss and mentor, Edson V. Mitchell. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/15/business/JAIN/JAIN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 846, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/15/business/JAIN/JAIN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/15/business/JAIN/JAIN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Star Faces Barriers to Deutsche Bank’s Top Job', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Star Faces Barriers to Deutsche Bank’s Top Job', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Germany', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Deutsche Bank AG', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-14T18:26:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Global Business', 'byline': {'original': 'By Landon Thomas Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Landon', '