loyment in Gaza standing at 45.2 percent for the second half of 2010, one of the highest rates in the world, even though Israel eased its blockade of the Palestinian coastal strip in that period.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/15/world/GAZA/GAZA-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'U.N. Charts High Jobless Rate in Gaza, Despite Israel’s Easing of Blockade', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.N. Charts High Jobless Rate in Gaza, Despite Israel’s Easing of Blockade', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Palestinians', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Unemployment', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Gaza Strip', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-14T18:33:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ethan Bronner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ethan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bronner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/75783515-cb1c-533f-b2b8-472c494439e6', 'word_count': 487, 'uri': 'nyt://article/75783515-cb1c-533f-b2b8-472c494439e6'}, {'abstract': 'Like pasta, cannellini beans are a good staple to have on hand in a city kitchen pantry, and an hour of gentle simmering is usually all it takes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/15/dining/in-a-small-space-keep-beans-at-the-ready-city-kitchen.html', 'snippet': 'Like pasta, cannellini beans are a good staple to have on hand in a city kitchen pantry, and an hour of gentle simmering is usually all it takes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WE all have to eat, and we all want dinner. More often than not, I want dinner at home. To me, it’s the best place to be. I like to cook, I’m fairly confident I’ll produce something good, I know it’s going to be a lot less expensive than a restaurant meal, and with a few good friends around the table and a bottle of wine, it’s bound to be convivial. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/15/dining/CITY/CITY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 451, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/15/dining/CITY/CITY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 451}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/15/dining/CITY/CITY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/15/dining/CITY/CITY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/15/dining/CITY/CITY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Small Space, Big Flavor: First, Start the Beans', 'kicker': 'City Kitchen', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Small Space, Big Flavor: First, Start the Beans', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Beans', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Salads', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-14T18:34:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Tanis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tanis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/26a7bb11-3265-5fd6-8a8f-0ecb53712f7b', 'word_count': 861, 'uri': 'nyt://article/26a7bb11-3265-5fd6-8a8f-0ecb53712f7b'}, {'abstract': 'A long-time chef at Chez Panisse and a passionate home cook, David Tanis will write a weekly column called “City Kitchen.”', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/14/introducing-city-kitchen-a-new-cooking-column/', 'snippet': 'A long-time chef at Chez Panisse and a passionate home cook, David Tanis will write a weekly column called “City Kitchen.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Today, we’re introducing a new column about home cooking written by David Tanis. Called City Kitchen, it will run weekly in the Dining section of The New York Times, and online. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Introducing City Kitchen, a New Cooking Column', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-14T18:36:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Tanis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tanis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/84d4aed2-0f79-5162-8678-96a65f969035', 'word_count': 337, 'uri': 'nyt://article/84d4aed2-0f79-5162-8678-96a65f969035'}, {'abstract': 'CBS News said Tuesday that Scott Pelley should get credit for improving the ratings for the CBS Evening News in his first week when compared to Katie Couric’s results during the same week last year.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/14/cbs-sees-better-news-in-pelleys-ratings/', 'snippet': 'CBS News said Tuesday that Scott Pelley should get credit for improving the ratings for the CBS Evening News in his first week when compared to Katie Couric’s results during the same week last year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CBS News took issue Tuesday with early comparisons between ratings for its old anchor, Katie Couric, and its new anchor, Scott Pelley, saying that Mr. Pelley should get credit for improving the ratings for the newscast in his first week when compared to Ms. Couric’s results during the same week last year.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'CBS Sees Better News in Pelley’s Ratings', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ratings and Rating Systems', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pelley, Scott', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CBS Corp', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CBS News', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-14T18:36:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Carter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fed211e4-4cb4-5ea1-a609-3ebf719846ab', 'word_count': 281, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fed211e4-4cb4-5ea1-a609-3ebf719846ab'}, {'abstract': 'Scott Raab is finishing a fan’s memoir that will mix his passion for Cleveland teams with his loathing of LeBron James.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/15/sports/basketball/lebron-jamess-worst-fan-has-a-book-deal-and-a-happy-ending.html', 'snippet': 'Scott Raab is finishing a fan’s memoir that will mix his passion for Cleveland teams with his loathing of LeBron James.', 'lead_paragraph': 'From Section 104 of American Airlines Arena in Miami on Sunday night, Scott Raab witnessed a personal and literary miracle: the Heat lost the N.B.A. finals to the Dallas Mavericks. Raab called LeBron James the Whore of Akron last September during his reporting for a coming memoir that mixes his passion for the Cleveland teams he loves with his loathing of James for bolting the Cavaliers for the Heat.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/15/sports/basketball/15raab-pic/15raab-pic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/15/sports/basketball/15raab-pic/15raab-pic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/15/sports/basketball/15raab-pic/15raab-pic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Critic of James Has a Happy Ending for His Book', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Critic of James Has a Happy Ending for His Book', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Miami Heat', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'James, LeBron', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Raab, Scott', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-14T18:39:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Sandomir', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sandomir', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/79354ee5-6f9c-504d-9f86-dc8a52f1cbb4', 'word_count': 757, 'uri': 'nyt://article/79354ee5-6f9c-504d-9f86-dc8a52f1cbb4'}, {'abstract': 'Celine’s resort collection boasted leopard, floral brocade and neon pink separates.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/14/just-one-look-i-celine-resort/', 'snippet': 'Celine’s resort collection boasted leopard, floral brocade and neon pink separates.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Wild patterned pants dominated the fall runways, and, judging by Céline’s resort collection, which included leopard, jailhouse stripes and neon pink trousers, they’re not going anywhere. Other highlights: this mix of a floral brocade jacket and bustier atop classic separates (and, ironically, a logo tee from the pioneers of the no logo “it” item). The collection offered a taste of Phoebe Philo’s past hits (leather patchwork coats and bags reminiscent of pre-fall) and a glimpse of the future (neon yellow, pink, orange and color-blocked renditions of the design house’s classic bags like the luggage tote).', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Just One Look | Céline Resort', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-06-14T18:45:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Chelsea Zalopany', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chelsea', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zalopany', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported',