an designed to be more palatable to interest groups and to Parliament.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/15/world/europe/15britain.html', 'snippet': 'Prime Minister David Cameron released a new, watered-down version of the plan designed to be more palatable to interest groups and to Parliament.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — After enduring months of criticism over his bold proposal to drastically overhaul Britain’s publicly financed National Health Service, Prime Minister David Cameron on Tuesday released a new, watered-down version of the plan designed to be more palatable to interest groups and to Parliament. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/15/world/BRITAIN/BRITAIN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 655, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/15/world/BRITAIN/BRITAIN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/15/world/BRITAIN/BRITAIN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Cameron Revises Overhaul Plan for British Health Care', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Cameron Revises Overhaul Plan for British Health System', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cameron, David', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Reform and Reorganization', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-14T18:55:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name':