 State Senator Roy J. McDonald on Tuesday comes as the governor has introduced his bill to both houses of the Legislature.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ALBANY — New York is within a single vote of legalizing gay marriage after a second Republican state senator said on Tuesday that he would support the measure should it come to the floor this week.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Same-Sex Marriage Within One Vote of Passage in Albany', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-06-14T20:42:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicholas Confessore and Danny Hakim', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Confessore', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Danny', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hakim', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3e0cac03-184e-5ae5-96a8-bce46acf02f8', 'word_count': 367, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3e0cac03-184e-5ae5-96a8-bce46acf02f8'}, {'abstract': 'Riccardo Tisci combined neon visors and rope heels with bird-of-paradise and panther prints in his resort collection for Givenchy.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/14/just-one-look-givenchy-resort/', 'snippet': 'Riccardo Tisci combined neon visors and rope heels with bird-of-paradise and panther prints in his resort collection for Givenchy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At his Givenchy resort presentation, the designer Riccardo Tisci was clear: “The collection is still 1950s mixed with surfing, but everything is about cropping and pieces missing.” Dangling dorm-style key chains, neon visors and rope heels (inspired by Birkenstocks) accompanied bird-of-paradise prints and a computerized update of last season’s panther print in the form of pencil skirts paired with cutout stretch-knit sweatshirts. “My obsession is daytime to evening,” Tisci says. As proof he showed a very French couture frilled bustier evening dress with a cropped sweater thrown over. “I’m obsessed with sweatshirts and T-shirts — that’s how I live my life.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Just One Look | Givenchy Resort', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-06-14T20:45:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Chelsea Zalopany', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chelsea', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zalopany', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bffea441-fac6-525b-a850-b9dc123129de', 'word_count': 104, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bffea441-fac6-525b-a850-b9dc123129de'}, {'abstract': 'Masa, in the Time Warner Center, is the fearsomely expensive subject of this week’s review by Sam Sifton. What makes a four-star restaurant?', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/14/reviewing-masa/', 'snippet': 'Masa, in the Time Warner Center, is the fearsomely expensive subject of this week’s review by Sam Sifton. What makes a four-star restaurant?', 'lead_paragraph': '\xa0', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Reviewing Masa', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sushi', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-14T20:52:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style',