: 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-15T01:12:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/79a10398-f995-513b-aa8a-f9d48b689bae', 'word_count': 411, 'uri': 'nyt://article/79a10398-f995-513b-aa8a-f9d48b689bae'}, {'abstract': 'A specially appointed medical panel is recommending that Liliane Bettencourt, the elderly L’Oréal heiress, be protected by a guardian because of her deteriorating health.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/15/world/europe/15briefs-Loreal.html', 'snippet': 'A specially appointed medical panel is recommending that Liliane Bettencourt, the elderly L’Oréal heiress, be protected by a guardian because of her deteriorating health.', 'lead_paragraph': ' A specially appointed medical panel is recommending that Liliane Bettencourt, the elderly L’Oréal heiress,\xa0be protected by a guardian because of her deteriorating health, according to the newspaper Le Monde. The panel’s members did not examine Mrs. Bettencourt, 88, the newspaper said, but based their opinion on her medical records.\xa0Her lawyer, Pascal Wilhelm, declined to comment Tuesday “due to the current situation.”\xa0 Mrs. Bettencourt’s daughter, Françoise Bettencourt-Meyers, has asked for court-appointed guardianship; France’s highest appeals court will review the request to determine whether it can be imposed without Mrs. Bettencourt’s support. \xa0 ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'France: Guardian Suggested for Heiress', 'kicker': 'World Briefing | Europe', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'France: Guardian Suggested for Heiress', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': "L'Oreal SA", 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, 