From 5 to 10 pictures will be nominated each year.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/15/another-oscar-shakeup-number-of-best-picture-nominees-will-vary/', 'snippet': 'From 5 to 10 pictures will be nominated each year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — Delivering yet another jolt to an Oscar system that has been shaken by changing rules and shifting dates, the Academy of Motion Picture Arts and Sciences says that it will now shift to a variable system under which the number of best picture nominees can range from 5 to 10 in any year. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Another Oscar Shakeup: Number of Best Picture Nominees Will Vary', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Academy Awards (Oscars)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Davis, Bruce', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Franco, James', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hudson, Dawn', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sherak, Tom', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ACADEMY OF MOTION PICTURE ARTS AND SCIENCES', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Los Angeles (Calif)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-15T13:33:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Cieply', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cieply', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/50148aba-5450-561a-861d-7b4116c8af0d', 'word_count': 382, 'uri': 'nyt://article/50148aba-545