 {'abstract': 'The collection was up to the minute in current trends, from color blocking to funky pattern-on-pattern suits.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/15/just-one-look-gucci-resort/', 'snippet': 'The collection was up to the minute in current trends, from color blocking to funky pattern-on-pattern suits.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a well executed version of Gucci minimalism, Frida Giannini relied on gold to add a lustrous note to simple basics, like this shining pleated skirt. The collection was up to the minute in current trends, from color blocking (red, white and purple sheath dresses) to funky pattern-on-pattern suits. Other standouts: her python skirt, lamé top and a black jumper with a medallion broach on the shoulder, all accented in gold, what else? ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Just One Look | Gucci Resort', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-06-15T23:00:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Chelsea Zalopany', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chelsea', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zalopany', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8ac87054-bc7d-5a04-9842-c237ca14ac5b', 'word_count': 79, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8ac87054-bc7d-5a04-9842-c237ca14ac5b'}, {'abstract': "The Times's Simone Oliver and Stephanie Rosenbloom get refreshing tips for selecting sunglasses.", 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/fashion/100000000866490/finding-frames-that-fit.html', 'snippet': "The Times's Simone Oliver and Stephanie Rosenbloom get refreshing tips for selecting sunglasses.", 'lead_paragraph': "The Times's Simone Oliver and Stephanie Rosenbloom get refreshing tips for selecting sunglasses.", 'source': '