3d9cbd1732'}, {'abstract': 'The governor said lawmakers, deadlocked on whether to strengthen the laws or just renew them, will not leave Albany until they pass a bill.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/16/nyregion/cuomo-gives-legislature-ultimatum-on-extending-rent-laws.html', 'snippet': 'The governor said lawmakers, deadlocked on whether to strengthen the laws or just renew them, will not leave Albany until they pass a bill.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ALBANY — Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo said Wednesday that he would not let lawmakers leave the capital at the scheduled end of the legislative session early next week unless they had come to an agreement on how to extend the state’s rent regulation laws.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '30', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Cuomo Gives Lawmakers Ultimatum on Rent Laws', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Cuomo Gives Lawmakers Ultimatum On Rent Laws', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'State Legislatures', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rent Control and Stabilization', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-16T01:11:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Thomas Kaplan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Thomas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kaplan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f94bf2c7-ddc9-59c8-8c5a-8010e902fbbc', 'word_count': 387, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f94bf2c7-ddc9-59c8-8c5a-8010e902fbbc'}, {'abstract': 'A lack of competition among wireless carriers offering cross-border roaming services has international data roaming prices at exorbitant levels.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/16/opinion/16thu3.html', 'snippet': 'A lack of competition among wireless carriers offering cross-border roaming services has international data roaming prices at exorbitant levels.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a plugged-in, hyperglobalized world, one might expect that our communications networks would allow us to roam widely, cellphones and tablets connected to the matrix, no matter the location. But when it comes to telecommunications pricing, globalization stopped at the border. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '34', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Unaffordable Roaming', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Unaffordable Roaming', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Telephones and Telecommunications', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prices (Fares, Fees and Rates)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wireless Communications', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Trade and World Market', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Antitrust Laws and Competition Issues', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-16T01:11:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/b711e01a-5f17-55e5-9f10-40e48a79a5f6', 'word_count': 277, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b711e01a-5f17-55e5-9f10-40e48a79a5f6'}, {'abstract': 'The clash between the Canucks and the Bruins in Game 7 of the Stanley Cup finals brought into focus the difference in the sporting cultures of Vancouver and Boston.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/16/sports/hockey/stanley-cup-finals-cities-s