lf/at-the-us-open-a-few-golfers-dare-to-have-fun.html', 'snippet': 'The U.S. Open is usually a staid and serious affair, but this year the golfers and organizers are aware of the entertainment factor.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BETHESDA, Md. — Four competitors rocking out on the eve of the 111th United States Open in a new music video may, or may not, rival the impact of the Chicago Bears’ “Super Bowl Shuffle” from Super Bowl XX, but the slickly produced spoof has lightened the atmosphere of a traditionally staid week.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/16/sports/JP-GOLF-2/JP-GOLF-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/16/sports/JP-GOLF-2/JP-GOLF-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/16/sports/JP-GOLF-2/JP-GOLF-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/16/sports/JP-GOLF-2/JP-GOLF-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/16/sports/JP-GOLF-2/JP-GOLF-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'At Congressional, a Few Players Dare to Talk About Fun', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'At Congressional, A Few Players Dare To Talk About Fun', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fowler, Rickie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': '