m/2011/06/16/sports/hockey/boston-wins-game-7-on-road-for-first-cup-since-72.html', 'snippet': 'With opportune scoring and record-setting goaltending, the Boston Bruins won the Stanley Cup with a 4-0 victory over the Vancouver Canucks in Game 7 of the National Hockey League finals.', 'lead_paragraph': 'VANCOUVER, British Columbia — For nearly four decades, the Boston Bruins fought a losing battle with futility and sorrow. Five times they had reached the Stanley Cup finals and had not raised the silver chalice in triumph. On Wednesday night, after 39 years, the Bruins became N.H.L. champions.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/16/sports/16stanley9_blog/16stanley9_blog-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/16/sports/16stanley9_blog/16stanley9_blog-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/16/sports/16stanley9_blog/16stanley9_blog-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Boston Wins Game 7 on Road for First Cup Since ’72', 'kicker': 'Bruins 4, Canucks 0', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bruins Break Through', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Marchand, Brad', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Vancouver Canucks', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stanley Cup', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Boston Bruins', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Thomas, Tim', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'nam