0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/5180bc8f-ee41-5f39-8ed0-984d77bb8620'}, {'abstract': 'President Obama is coming under criticism from the left and the right for his decision to participate in the NATO military campaign in Libya.', 'web_url': 'https://atwar.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/16/libya-campaign-reveals-the-doves-on-the-left-and-right/', 'snippet': 'President Obama is coming under criticism from the left and the right for his decision to participate in the NATO military campaign in Libya.', 'lead_paragraph': 'And you thought the only thing that Democratic Representative Dennis Kucinich and House Speaker John Boehner shared were their humble origins in Ohio. Not so. President Obama’s decision to bring American firepower to the NATO campaign in Libya has brought the two men together. Both men say that Mr. Obama’s decision to launch airstrikes in Libya is a violation of the War Powers Act, which requires presidents to seek permission from Congress to go to war. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Libya Campaign Reveals the Doves — on the Left and Right', 'kicker': 'At War', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Boehner, John A', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jones, Walter B', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kucinich, Dennis J', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'North Atlantic Treaty Organization', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocati