lled that. Fortunately for Mr. Bronk, no one was checking press credentials at the door.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Even a Media Circus Needs a Clown', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suspensions, Dismissals and Resignations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stern, Howard', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Weiner, Anthony D', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brooklyn (NYC)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-16T21:29:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ashley Parker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ashley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Parker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/624598d8-ebb7-56f6-9b36-440ef713b85e', 'word_count': 594, 'uri': 'nyt://article/624598d8-ebb7-56f6-9b36-440ef713b85e'}, {'abstract': 'Joan Baker performs “psychic credit checks” for landlords, and says she has a near-flawless record.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/19/realestate/landlords-rely-on-psychic-to-vet-tenants.html', 'snippet': 'Joan Baker performs “psychic credit checks” for landlords, and says she has a near-flawless record.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BARUCH HERZFELD, a landlord in Brooklyn, sometimes finds himself unsure about a potential tenant. Because his buildings are in neighborhoods like Bushwick and Bedford-Stuyvesant, which are frequented by artistic and creative workers, a number of his applicants have questionable credit or spotty incomes. ', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [