 Prism, the Mechanics of Time.” As for Cage, what interests him most, he says in an archival interview (in French), are the “ugliest things,” because in the end we realize that they’re not ugly at all, “but life itself.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Sound of (Experimental) Music', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': "Movie Review | 'The Colors of the Prism, the Mechanics of Time'", 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cage, John', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-17T00:14:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rachel Saltz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rachel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Saltz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/ebb73592-ee60-5296-9d2b-2aaaffbee59a', 'word_count': 324, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ebb73592-ee60-5296-9d2b-2aaaffbee59a'}, {'abstract': 'Injuries and lack of leadership took a toll on the Canucks, who lost to the Bruins after leading the Stanley Cup finals series three games to two.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/17/sports/hockey/the-morning-after-dissecting-what-went-wrong.html', 'snippet': 'Injuries and lack of leadership took a toll on the Canucks, who lost to the Bruins after leading the Stanley Cup finals series three games to two.', 'lead_paragraph': 'VANCOUVER, British Columbia — The first question on the minds of Vancouver Canucks fans Thursday morning was: what went so terribly wrong in the Stanley Cup finals?', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimed