 serious crime. But the consequences can be significant for the people arrested.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/17/nyregion/push-for-marijuana-arrests-in-ny-has-side-effects.html', 'snippet': 'The Bloomberg administration says arrests for minor marijuana possession help drive down serious crime. But the consequences can be significant for the people arrested.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Bloomberg administration says that by arresting more than 350,000 people for having small amounts of marijuana since 2002, the police have helped drive down serious crime — and that the consequences for the people locked up have been minimal.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Side Effects of Arrests for Marijuana', 'kicker': 'About New York', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Side Effects Of Arrests For Marijuana', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Minorities', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloomberg, Michael R', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marijuana', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-17T00:54:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jim Dwyer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dwyer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fb8e268b-608a-5b51-a848-b34e6410f08b', 'word_count': 775, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fb8e268b-608a-5b51-a848-b34e6410f08b'}, {'abstract': 'Government workers swarmed Trenton after Gov. Chris Christie and legislative leaders agreed to sharply increase the contributions public employees must make into their health insurance and pensions plans.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/17/nyregion/state-workers-swarm-trenton-to-oppose-health-and-pension-increases.html', 'snippet': 'Government workers swarmed Trenton after Gov. Chris Christie and legislative leaders agreed to sharply increase the contributions public employees must make into their health insurance and pensions plans.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Thousands of angry government workers swarmed New Jersey’s Capitol on Thursday and some were briefly arrested, one day after Gov. Chris Christie and legislative leaders agreed to sharply increase the contributions public employees must make into their health insurance and pensions plans.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '32', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/17/nyregion/JERSEY/JERSEY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/17/nyregion/JERSEY/JERSEY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/17/nyregion/JERSEY/JERSEY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/17/nyregion/JERSEY/JERSEY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/17/nyregion/JERSEY/JERSEY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Workers Swarm Trenton on Benefit Changes', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'State Workers Swarm Trenton to Protest Charges to Their Health and Pension Plans', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': No