7-ab57-b92220904fbf'}, {'abstract': 'The law does apply to the NATO campaign in Libya, but that is no excuse to end it prematurely.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/17/opinion/17fri1.html', 'snippet': 'The law does apply to the NATO campaign in Libya, but that is no excuse to end it prematurely.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It would be hugely costly — for this country’s credibility, for the future of NATO and for the people of Libya — if Congress were to force President Obama to abandon military operations over Libya. However, Mr. Obama cannot evade his responsibility, under the War Powers Act, to seek Congressional approval to continue the operation.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '34', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Libya and the War Powers Act', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Libya and the War Powers Act: The law does apply to the NATO campaign, but that is no excuse to end it prematurely', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'War Powers Act (1973)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Boehner, John A', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'North Atlantic Treaty Organization', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Libya', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Qaddafi, Muammar el-', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-17T01:45:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion'