 because they want to.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/17/what-youre-reading-this-summer-the-results-of-our-survey/', 'snippet': 'A list of what teachers and students told us they’d be reading this summer, either because they have to or because they want to.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Update: June 7, 2012: We’re asking people to talk about #summerreading on Twitter today, and blogging about it. We also have a summer-long reading contest going that starts June 15. Join in!', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What You’re Reading This Summer: The Results of Our Survey', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-06-17T12:22:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By Shannon Doyne and Katherine Schulten', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Shannon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Doyne', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Katherine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schulten', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/30207cd5-1257-5a87-958f-d46b7c8982ee', 'word_count': 1070, 'uri': 'nyt://article/30207cd5-1257-5a87-958f-d46b7c8982ee'}, {'abstract': 'Beecher’s Handmade Cheese, from Seattle, will make cheese and sandwiches, salads and prepared foods.', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/17/beechers-cheesemaking-on-display-in-manhattan/', 'snippet': 'Beecher’s Handmade Cheese, from Seattle, will make cheese and sandwiches, salads and prepared foods.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Beecher’s Handmade Cheese, which has been making and selling cheeses in the Pike Place Market in Seattle for the last seven years, will open a cheese-making factory, retail store and restaurant in the Flatiron district on June 24. They’ve taken over 8,000 square feet of space on three levels in a landmark building, where a gleaming steel 8,000 gallon milk tank stands at attention and cheesemakers are at work over troughs of curds and whey in a huge room enclosed in glass. Above it is a mezzanine with tables for 25 where customers can take the sandwiches, salads, panini, soups, and other items sold on the main floor. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Beecher’s — Cheesemaking on Display in Manhattan', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-06-17T12:29:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c388fb25-f58c-5d62-8d97-acc068a5e3f7', 'word_count': 354, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c388fb25-f58c-5d62-8d97-acc068a5e3f7'}, {'abstract': 'Nathaniel Rothschild plans to make a large takeover within the next five months through his latest investment venture, Vallares, which had a successful initial public offering in London.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2011/06/17/rothschilds-vallares-readies-to-make-big-deal/', 'snippet': 'Nathaniel Rothschild plans to make a large takeover within the next five months through his latest investment venture, Vallares, which had a successful initial public offering in London.', 'lead_paragraph': '8:34 p.m. | Updated ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Offering Complete, Rothschild Company to Seek Energy Deals', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo'