{'abstract': 'Food-related events around the city.', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/17/weekend-fare-48/', 'snippet': 'Food-related events around the city.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After two decades as a mainstay restaurant in SoHo, Peter Hoffman’s Savoy, 70 Prince Street (Crosby Street), closes  on Saturday. An $85 five-course menu will be served. True to its reputation as a leader in the farm-to-table movement, Savoy’s last meal will have dishes based on ingredients available at the Greenmarket. The first seating is at 6 p.m. Reservations at\xa0 (212) 219-8570.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Weekend Fare', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-06-17T17:45:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bao Ong', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bao', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ong', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2bce9e38-6856-5959-9293-ac7ff446a28d', 'word_count': 742, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2bce9e38-6856-5959-9293-ac7ff446a28d'}, {'abstract': 'June 17, 2011 - Megan Liberman and Ashley Parker discuss social media in politics, and Nicholas Confessore reports as New York lawmakers debate gay marriage.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/us/politics/100000000869549/caucus--politicians-and-social-media.html', 'snippet': 'June 17, 2011 - Megan Liberman and Ashley Parker discuss social media in politics, and Nicholas Confessore reports as New York lawmakers debate gay marriage.', 'lead_paragraph': 'June 17, 2011 - Megan Liberman and Ashley Parker discuss social media in politics, and Nicholas Confessore reports as New York lawmakers debate gay marriage.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia