 embraces influences including Gaspar Noé’s film “Into the Void,” the band the Smiths and the lo-fi musician R. Stevie Moore.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JUST over a week ago the rapper and singer Theophilus London took the stage at the Brooklyn Museum in a custom-made navy jacket with gold buttons lining the sleeves — “Buttons is so swag,” he had tweeted earlier — and loads of gold jewelry (he favors what he calls “old lady jewelry”), as well as a signature cap and sunglasses. This was his warm-up outfit, for the sound check; for the show he donned a sequined sweater and hat.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/19/arts/PLAYLIST-1/PLAYLIST-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/19/arts/PLAYLIST-1/PLAYLIST-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/19/arts/PLAYLIST-1/PLAYLIST-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 680, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/19/arts/PLAYLIST-1/PLAYLIST-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/19/arts/PLAYLIST-1/PLAYLIST-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Swirl of Influences in a Psychedelic Haze', 'kicker': 'Playlist | Theophilus London', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Swirl of Influences in a Psychedelic Haze', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'London, T