 call connecting them to their State Senator.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When New York State Senator Joseph P. Addabbo Jr., reversed course earlier this week and supported legislation that would legalize same-sex marriage in the state, he said that what had changed were the number of people contacting him asking him to vote for the bill. As was reported in The Times on Monday:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Want to Call Your Senator? Advocates Make It Easy', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Same-Sex Marriage, Civil Unions and Domestic Partnerships', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMERICAN RED CROSS', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Facebook.com', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Google Inc', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Human Rights Campaign', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Organization for Marriage', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Twitter', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-17T19:41:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joshua Brustein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joshua', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Brustein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fd0e2350-5e04-5024-a491-188f6eb80568', 'word_count': 552, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fd0e2350-5e04-5024-a491-188f6eb80568'}, {'abstract': 'Joseph Losey’s “Romantic Englishwoman” (1975), newly released on DVD, par