er Theyskens’s time at Nina Ricci and Rochas for that — is changing the definition of downtown cool. Hence the cutout yet flowing shirtdress paired with loose slacks. For the label’s first resort collection, color entered the game, like these camouflage pants and updated boots. There were also hits of neon blue lining messenger bag straps, along with coral hues brightening up blouses, blazers and trousers.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Just One Look | Theyskens’ Theory Resort', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-06-17T19:50:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Chelsea Zalopany', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chelsea', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zalopany', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e2947796-85dd-5f64-b1e6-4bd967078f76', 'word_count': 83, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e2947796-85dd-5f64-b1e6-4bd967078f76'}, {'abstract': 'Making it clear(er) that Dads are welcome here.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/17/announcing-the-fathers-forum/', 'snippet': 'Making it clear(er) that Dads are welcome here.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In my very first Motherlode post, back in October of 2008, I wrote:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Announcing the Fathers Forum', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': "Father's Day", 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-17T19:50:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lisa Belkin', 'p