 human rights group, there is no lack of footage of Palestinians’ weekly protests against Israel’s security barrier in the West Bank.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/17/palestinians-film-west-bank-protests-with-israeli-supplied-cameras/', 'snippet': 'Due to the efforts of an Israeli human rights group, there is no lack of footage of Palestinians’ weekly protests against Israel’s security barrier in the West Bank.', 'lead_paragraph': 'While journalists have found themselves scouring the Internet in search of video from protests across the Middle East recently, one protest movement, by small groups of villagers opposed to Israel’s security barrier in the West Bank, has gotten far less attention. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Palestinians Record West Bank Protests With Cameras Supplied by Israelis', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests, and Riots', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Palestinians', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "B'Tselem", 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'West Bank', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-17T22:18:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Mackey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mackey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/12972020-431e-5a70-97ff-e23fe0479348', 'word_count': 550, 'uri': 'nyt://article/12972020-431e-5a70-97ff-e23fe0479348'}, {'abstract