ion/for-john-c-liu-sundays-are-for-little-league-and-dim-sum.html', 'snippet': 'On Sundays, Little League baseball and family dinners are on the city comptroller’s mind, not fraud-busting and the Bloomberg administration.', 'lead_paragraph': 'John C. Liu, 44, New York City’s feisty and ambitious comptroller and the first Asian-American to win a major elective office in the city, has at times been at odds with the Bloomberg administration. But on Sundays, Mr. Liu says, auditing, fraud-busting and the mayor are the last things on his mind. It’s a time for Little League and maybe a dim sum outing in Flushing, Queens, where Mr. Liu, a former actuary, arrived from Taiwan at age 5. He still lives there with his wife, Jenny, 43, a director at the New York Power Authority, and their son, Joey, 10. ', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/19/nyregion/19ROUTINE2/19ROUTINE2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/19/nyregion/19ROUTINE2/19ROUTINE2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/19/nyregion/19ROUTINE2/19ROUTINE2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Little League and Dim Sum', 'kicker': 'Sunday Routine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Little League and Dim Sum', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Liu, John C', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Office of the Comptroller (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Little League Baseball and Softball', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '