'}, {'abstract': 'Serena Williams has slugged through the rust and the naysayers on too many other occasions for anyone to be completely convinced that she won’t will her way to success again.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/19/sports/tennis/serena-williams-confronts-her-toughest-comeback.html', 'snippet': 'Serena Williams has slugged through the rust and the naysayers on too many other occasions for anyone to be completely convinced that she won’t will her way to success again.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Serena Williams has actually played more grass-court tennis than usual this year as she prepares for another Wimbledon. But Williams, who lost in the second round in Eastbourne last week, is still short on matches as she returns to the All England Club after nearly a year away from her sport and the Grand Slam tournaments that define it.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/19/sports/serena-silo/serena-silo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 569, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/19/sports/serena-silo/serena-silo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/19/sports/serena-silo/serena-silo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Serena Williams Is Facing Her Toughest Comeback', 'kicker': 'On Tennis', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Serena Williams Is Facing Her Toughest Comeback', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, Serena', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wimbledon Tenn