tps://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/19/us/19ttwater.html', 'snippet': 'The current drought in Texas is forcing tough decisions on how to use water from the Colorado River, which nourishes lakes in the Austin area and rice fields near the Gulf of Mexico coast.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On the cliffs surrounding Lake Buchanan in Central Texas, a white ring extends some 13 feet above the shoreline, marking where the water reaches when the lake is full. At nearby Lake Travis, staircases that once led to the water’s edge now end well above it.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/19/us/19ttwater-span/19ttwater-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 365, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/19/us/19ttwater-span/19ttwater-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 365}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/19/us/19ttwater-span/19TTWATER1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/19/us/19ttwater-span/19ttwater-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/19/us/19ttwater-span/19ttwater-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Amid Texas Drought, High-Stakes Battle Over Water', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Drought Raises Questions On Use of Colorado River', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drought', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Colorado River', 'rank': 2, 'major'