 and drugs overwhelming her organization’s ability to monitor them. But she had not provided a strategy to deal comprehensively with this problem — until now. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'F.D.A. Confronts Challenge of Monitoring Imports', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Agency Head Outlines Difficulties and Risks of Food and Drug Imports', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Food and Drug Administration', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Food Contamination and Poisoning', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Food', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-20T13:01:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Health', 'subsection_name': 'Money & Policy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gardiner Harris', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gardiner', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Harris', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/96ccb371-828e-53f2-84a9-bb149423e454', 'word_count': 1086, 'uri': 'nyt://article/96ccb371-828e-53f2-84a9-bb149423e454'}, {'abstract': 'The Caucus has compiled some of the best political quotes of the weekend.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/20/best-political-quotes-of-the-weekend-14/', 'snippet': 'The Caucus has compiled some of the best political quotes of the weekend.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Was your weekend too busy for paying attention to politics? No worries. The Caucus has compiled some of the best political quotes for you.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Best Political Quotes of the Weekend', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name