:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'subsection_name': 'Fitness & Nutrition', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gina Kolata', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gina', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kolata', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6cf997ee-9f0c-5aaa-a4b2-8827a57cf76e', 'word_count': 864, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6cf997ee-9f0c-5aaa-a4b2-8827a57cf76e'}, {'abstract': 'Monday Morning Skate: The top defensemen on the free agent market, a draft preview and how the Bruins built through the draft.', 'web_url': 'https://slapshot.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/20/monday-morning-skate-top-free-agent-defensemen-bruins-second-round-success-draft-preview/', 'snippet': 'Monday Morning Skate: The top defensemen on the free agent market, a draft preview and how the Bruins built through the draft.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The free agency signing period begins July 1 and many teams will be shopping for impact defenders. None are of the available ones are of the franchise-altering variety, but they could help teams in their pursuit of the Stanley Cup. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Monday Morning Skate: Top Free Agent Defensemen, Bruins’ Second-Round Success, Draft Preview', 'kicker': 'Slap Shot', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chiarelli, Peter', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jovanovski, Ed', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Julien, Claude', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kaberle, Tomas', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Luongo, Roberto', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Markov, Andrei', 'rank': 7,