18-3ec1-53cc-a206-ee0dd939bbe5'}, {'abstract': 'Word Up tries to fill a need for readers and writers in a northern Manhattan neighborhood.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/20/a-bookshop-opens-for-a-one-month-stand-in-washington-hts/', 'snippet': 'Word Up tries to fill a need for readers and writers in a northern Manhattan neighborhood.', 'lead_paragraph': '“This did not look like this two hours ago,” \xa0Veronica Liu said as she surveyed the crowd at Word Up, Washington Heights’ newest, possibly even first, pop-up bookstore. It was 8 p.m. on Friday. At 6 p.m. — Word Up’s stated opening time — Heights residents and newly recruited volunteers were still moving boxes into the former pharmacy storefront on Broadway and 176th Street, where the community bookstore is in residency until mid-July.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Bookshop Opens for a One-Month Stand in Washington Hts.', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Book Trade and Publishing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'WASHINGTON HEIGHTS (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-20T19:40:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jessica Loudis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jessica', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Loudis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bac10bdc-213e-5cf5-bf18-66d760238587', 'word_count': 385, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bac10bdc-213e-5cf5-bf18-66d760238587'}, {'abstract': 'Resort has that 1970s vibe: secretary scarf blouses, superwide trousers, trapeze dresses and this breezy, romperlike top and skirt ensemble.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/20/just-one-look-chloe-resort-collection/', 'snippet': 'Resort has that 1970s vibe: secretary scarf blouses, superwide trousers, trapeze dresses and this breezy, romperlike top and skirt ensemble.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Clare Waight Keller will make her debut at Chloé for spring 2012. But in the meantime, the design team is sticking to the DNA of the brand. Resort has that 1970s vibe: secretary scarf blouses, superwide trousers, trapeze dresses and this breezy, romperlike top and skirt ensemble.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Just One Look | Chloé Resort Collection', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-06-20T19:41:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Chelsea Zalopany', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chelsea', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zalopany', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/14ba3839-60c7-507c-98e9-47c378535559', 'word_count': 50, 'uri': 'nyt://article/14ba3839-60c7-507c-98e9-47c378535559'}, {'abstract': 'These crepes make a wonderful main course for a vegetarian dinner party.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/23/health/nutrition/23recipehealth.html', 'snippet': 'These crepes make a wonderful main course for a vegetarian dinner party.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A simple and elegant way to serve asparagus, this dish makes a great main course for a vegetarian dinner party. It can be assembled ahead of time and baked just before serving.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/21/science/23recipehealth/23recipehealth-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 382, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'l