8ec0-5c07-a80a-ea5c4be7b9ce'}, {'abstract': 'The European Union on Monday imposed additional sanctions on Belarus in response to the government’s crackdown on opposition groups and independent media.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/21/world/europe/21briefs-Belarus.html', 'snippet': 'The European Union on Monday imposed additional sanctions on Belarus in response to the government’s crackdown on opposition groups and independent media.', 'lead_paragraph': ' The European Union on Monday imposed additional sanctions on Belarus in response to the government’s crackdown on opposition groups and independent media. Officials condemned the imprisonment of about two dozen opposition figures for participating in an antigovernment protest last December. The sanctions apply to three major companies linked to the government, a prominent arms exporter, a judge and two prosecutors, a union spokeswoman said. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Belarus: European Union Imposes New Sanctions', 'kicker': 'World Briefing | EUROPE', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Belarus: European Union Imposes New Sanctions', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Belarus', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Union', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-21T00:07:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Schwirtz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schwirtz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/507d5cc8-0815-56aa-a62e-d0437ae938e5', 'word_count': 64, 'uri': 'nyt://article/507d5cc8-0815-56aa-a62e-d0437ae938e5'}, {'abstract': 'The economics news in Las Vegas may not be improving, but that’s not the concern of revelers as night turns to morning.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/21/us/21vegas.html', 'snippet': 'The economics news in Las Vegas may not be improving, but that’s not the concern of revelers as night turns to morning.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The economic news in the morning newspaper was grim this past weekend: another uptick in the unemployment rate for Las Vegas, to 12.4 percent from 12 percent. Room occupancy rates on the Strip are stagnant. There were tables to be had at some of the fancier restaurants around, and empty spots at craps tables at the Cosmopolitan, the hot new casino, during what should have been a prime hour.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/21/us/VEGAS/VEGAS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 335, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/21/us/VEGAS/VEGAS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 335}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/21/us/VEGAS/VEGAS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 668, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/21/us/VEGAS/VEGAS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/21/us/VEGAS/VEGAS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Witnesses to Sunrise Over the Strip', 'kicker': 'Out Here | Las Vegas', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Witnesses to Sunrise Over the Strip', 'name': None, 'seo': 