nt new claims in a million-acre buffer zone around the Grand Canyon was announced as the government awaits results of a study of potential environmental harm.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/21/science/earth/21canyon.html', 'snippet': 'A six-month extension to prevent new claims in a million-acre buffer zone around the Grand Canyon was announced as the government awaits results of a study of potential environmental harm.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The federal government on Monday extended for six months a moratorium on new uranium mining claims in a million-acre buffer zone around the Grand Canyon as it awaits the conclusions of a study of potential environmental harm to the region.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/21/us/CANYON/CANYON-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/21/us/CANYON/CANYON-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/21/us/CANYON/CANYON-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 629, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/21/us/CANYON/CANYON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/21/us/CANYON/CANYON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Uranium Mine Moratorium Extended at Grand Canyon', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Uranium Mine Moratorium Extended at Grand Canyon', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Salazar, Ken', 'r