r the 2012 Republican nomination for president official with a speech near the Statue of Liberty.', 'lead_paragraph': '10:48 a.m. | Updated Jon Huntsman described himself as a “governor, a businessman and a diplomat” and said that American needed “more than hope” as he made a formal announcement on Tuesday that he was in the crowded field of Republicans seeking the presidency.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jon Huntsman Makes His Announcement Speech', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Huntsman, Jon M Jr', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-21T12:48:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael D. Shear', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bb9fbfa7-7ef3-58a1-a314-191dbb95ac31', 'word_count': 427, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bb9fbfa7-7ef3-58a1-a314-191dbb95ac31'}, {'abstract': 'The board’s proposal to speed up unionization elections will undoubtedly please labor unions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/22/business/22labor.html', 'snippet': 'The board’s proposal to speed up unionization elections will undoubtedly please labor unions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a move that pleased labor unions, the National Labor Relations Board proposed new rules on Tuesday to speed up unionization elections.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'N.L.R.B. Rules Would Streamline