 agency passed the latest stage in the process when his agent told the Mets on Monday that Reyes would not engage in contract negotiations until after this season.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/22/sports/METS/METS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 853, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/22/sports/METS/METS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/22/sports/METS/METS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Reyes Postpones Contract Talks as Athletics Drop Mets', 'kicker': 'Athletics 7, Mets 3', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mets Want to Talk Contract, but Reyes Says Not Until Season Is Over', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Free Agents (Sports)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Oakland Athletics', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Reyes, Jose', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-21T21:01:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Waldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Waldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bb227b7c-bd9f-53fe-8547-c200f7459f85', 'word_count': 913, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bb227b7c-bd9f-53fe-8547-c200f7459f85'}, {'abstract': 'John Schaefer of WNYC radio hosted a League of Composers concert on Saturday night at the Miller Theater at Columbia University.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/22/arts/music/orchestra-of-the-league-of-composers-review.html', 'snippet': 'John Schaefer of WNYC radio hosted a League of Composers concert on Saturday night at the Miller Theater at Columbia University.', 'lead_paragraph': '“I wrote it when I was 100 years old” is something few people besides Elliott Carter can say.\xa0 Now 102, Mr. Carter, ever lively and lucid, was at the Miller Theater on Saturday evening to speak about his Concertino for Bass Clarinet and Chamber Orchestra, which received its American premiere with the Orchestra of the League of Composers, conducted by Louis Karchin.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/22/arts/LEAGUE1/LEAGUE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 718, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/22/arts/LEAGUE1/LEAGUE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/22/arts/LEAGUE1/LEAGUE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Talk Frames Performance of Recent Works', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Talk Frames Performance of Recent Works', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schaefer, John', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'League of Composers/International Society for Contemporary Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Miller Theater at 