ion': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/43b74af6-9a3f-519e-a814-3621274d258c', 'word_count': 701, 'uri': 'nyt://article/43b74af6-9a3f-519e-a814-3621274d258c'}, {'abstract': 'For some New Yorkers, the summer solstice is a litmus test: Are you thrilled that summer has arrived, or is it all downhill from here?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/22/nyregion/in-new-york-celebration-and-mourning-on-summer-solstice.html', 'snippet': 'For some New Yorkers, the summer solstice is a litmus test: Are you thrilled that summer has arrived, or is it all downhill from here?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Elise Emerson sat in the darkest nook of the darkest cafe she could find on the Upper West Side, trying to study and, as she put it, not to “get pessimistic.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/22/nyregion/SOLSTICE-SUB/SOLSTICE-SUB-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/22/nyregion/SOLSTICE-SUB/SOLSTICE-SUB-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/22/nyregion/SOLSTICE-SUB/SOLSTICE-SUB-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 737, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/22/nyregion/SOLSTICE-SUB/SOLSTICE-SUB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/22/nyregion/SOLSTICE-SUB/SOLSTICE-SUB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Celebration, and Mourning, on a Day With Lingering Sunlight', 'kicker': None, 'cont