y as an official candidate by collecting $1.2 million for his campaign at a New York fund-raiser.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/22/huntsman-finishes-opening-day-with-big-haul/', 'snippet': 'Jon M. Huntsman Jr. closed his first day as an official candidate by collecting $1.2 million for his campaign at a New York fund-raiser.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jon M. Huntsman Jr. opened his day on Tuesday by formally declaring his candidacy for the Republican presidential nomination. He closed it by accomplishing an equally important task: collecting $1.2 million for his campaign.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Huntsman Finishes Opening Day with Big Money Haul', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Huntsman, Jon M Jr', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-22T13:40:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeff Zeleny', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeff', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zeleny', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/39ded590-b522-5227-b0d7-e9d6a1e32e15', 'word_count': 310, 'uri': 'nyt://article/39ded590-b522-5227-b0d7-e9d6a1e32e15'}, {'abstract': 'The inspiration behind Massimiliano Giornetti’s super elegant Salvatore Ferragamo show: an artist at work in the south of somewhere.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/22/milan-top-5-salvatore-ferragamo/', 'snippet': 'The inspiration behind Massimiliano Giornetti’s super elegant Salvatore Ferragamo show: an artist at work in the south of somewhere.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The fringed wide-brimmed straw hat gave a hint of the inspiration behind Massimiliano Giornetti’s super-elegant Salvatore Ferragamo show: an artist in the south of somewhere. Italy, France, Spain. They all work. Wide-legged linen pants were worn with long, lean double-breasted sport jackets and cotton chore coats. My favorite was a white tunic-style shirt over white pants, with a natural linen double-breasted jacket worn open. The slingback espadrilles were the spot-on shoes from this house that was built on soles.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Milan Top 5 | Salvatore Ferragamo', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-06-22T14:00:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bruce Pask', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bruce', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pask', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2285c6fa-4dba-5fbf-a5d0-c2af020d953e', 'word_count': 88, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2285c6fa-4dba-5fbf-a5d0-c2af020d953e'}, {'abstract': 'Broad market indexes were off after the Federal Reserve said it would stand pat on its stimulus measures and not add any new programs to boost the economy for now.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/23/business/23markets.html', 'snippet': 'Broad market indexes were off after the Federal Reserve said it would stand pat on its stimulus measures and not add any new programs to boost the economy for now.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Stocks declined on Wednesday, halting a four-day rally, after the Federal Reserve lowered its forecast for economic growth and said it planned to end its $600 billion debt-purchase program this month as scheduled.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source'