wly opened Riverside Museum in Glasgow, designed by the architect Zaha Hadid, is dedicated to transportation and travel.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Capturing Glasgow’s industrial heritage and its geographic link to the sea, the new Riverside Museum, designed by Zaha Hadid, has just opened. Though Ms. Hadid lives in London, this museum devoted to transportation and travel is her first major commission to open in Britain.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Scottish Museum Dedicated to Transport and Travel', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Museums', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hadid, Zaha', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Glasgow (Scotland)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-22T17:05:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elaine Glusac', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elaine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Glusac', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6aa85a10-3a53-5fd7-afc6-eff343cba6e2', 'word_count': 154, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6aa85a10-3a53-5fd7-afc6-eff343cba6e2'}, {'abstract': 'Republican leaders unveiled two resolutions to address the tensions over President Obama’s authority to continue the military mission in Libya.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/23/us/politics/23powers.html', 'snippet': 'Republican leaders unveiled two resolutions to address the tensions over President Obama’s authority to continue the military mission in Libya.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Speaker John A. Boehner of Ohio on Wednesday warned that the House was unlikely to authorize continued American participation in the NATO-led air war in Libya at its current level