': 'nyt://article/4941a6ce-fb1f-5831-99ec-46423d1fa5ef', 'word_count': 1204, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4941a6ce-fb1f-5831-99ec-46423d1fa5ef'}, {'abstract': 'Bahrain’s state news agency reports that eight opposition activists were sentenced to life in prison on Wednesday.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/22/bahrain-sentences-activists-to-life-in-jail/', 'snippet': 'Bahrain’s state news agency reports that eight opposition activists were sentenced to life in prison on Wednesday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Updated | 6:27 p.m. As my colleagues Lara El Gibaly and David Jolly report, eight opposition activists were sentenced to life in prison in Bahrain on Wednesday for what the state news agency described as “plotting to topple the government,” during two months of demonstrations earlier this year.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bahrain Sentences Activists to Life in Jail', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mushaima, Hassan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bahrain', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-22T18:00:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Mackey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mackey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/12e4b383-427e-5346-a92c-5ce1f40f98c3', 'word_count': 884, 'uri': 'nyt://article/12e4b383-427e-5346-a92c-5ce1f40f98c3'}, {'abstract': 'The ensemble cast will feature Steve Guttenberg, Julie Kavner, Marlo Thomas, Caroline Allen, Ari Graynor, Danny Hoch, Fred Melamed, Grant Shaud, Lisa Emery and Bill Army.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/22/casting-announced-for-relatively-speaking-comedies-by-woody-allen-elaine-may-and-ethan-coen/', 'snippet': 'The ensemble cast will feature Steve Guttenberg, Julie Kavner, Marlo Thomas, Caroline Allen, Ari Graynor, Danny Hoch, Fred Melamed, Grant Shaud, Lisa Emery and Bill Army.', 'lead_paragraph': 'What exactly results from a Broadway show featuring the works of Ethan Coen, Elaine May and Woody Allen? That vague if tantalizing proposition offered by “Relatively Speaking,” a triple bill of one-act comedies by those authors and directed by John Turturro, came into somewhat clearer focus on Wednesday with the announcement of its ensemble cast and other details. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Casting Announced for ‘Relatively Speaking’ Comedies by Woody Allen, Elaine May and Ethan Coen', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ALLEN, WOODY', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Atkinson Theater', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-22T18:00:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ec6ad6ec-26be-5bdc-95ab-a99479541e8b', 'word_count': 357, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ec6ad6ec-26be-5bdc-95ab-a99479541e8b'}, {'abstract': 'Brian Lam, editor of Gizmodo, is leaving Gawker’s popular gadget and technology blog.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/22/brian-lam-leaves-gizmodo/', 'snippet': 'Brian Lam, editor of Gizmodo, is leaving Gawker