er-firepot-accidents.html', 'snippet': 'A maker of pourable fuel gel for decorative firepots is recalling nearly a half-million bottles after learning of dozens of accidents, including two near-fatal ones in New York, the Consumer Product Safety Commission said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A maker of pourable fuel gel for decorative firepots is recalling about a half-million bottles after learning of dozens of accidents, including two near-fatal ones in New York, the Consumer Product Safety Commission announced on Wednesday. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/23/nyregion/CANDLE/CANDLE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 691, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Manufacturer Recalls Pourable Fuel Gel After Injuries in Firepot Accidents', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Firepot Accidents Prompt Recall of Pourable Fuel Gel', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recalls and Bans of Products', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Consumer Product Safety Commission', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Napa Home & Garden Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-22T19:13:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By David M. Halbfinger', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ffc776de-2740-5a5e-84ec-33a99e966075', 'word_count': 494, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ffc776de-2740-5a5e-84ec-33a99e966075'}, {'abstract': 'The assembled news media wasn’t nearly this dismissive of, say, Newt Gingrich when he announced several weeks and a couple of credit lines at Tiffany’s ago.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/22/why-all-the-scorn-for-huntsman/', 'snippet': 'The assembled news media wasn’t nearly this dismissive of, say, Newt Gingrich when he announced several weeks and a couple of credit lines at Tiffany’s ago.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jon M. Huntsman Jr. is actually running for president? And saying he respects President Obama, no less?Is he mocking us? Does he think we’re a bunch of idiots?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Why All the Scorn for Huntsman?', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-06-22T19:14:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matt Bai', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matt', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bai', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8f165a46-7adc-54e9-bf98-3b2b65eed0c3', 'word_count': 795, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8f165a46-7adc-54e9-bf98-3b2b65eed0c3'}, {'abstract': 'A 1720 stone house in upstate New York; a pair of cabins in Sedona, Ariz.; and a duplex condo in Chicago.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/23/greathomesanddestinations/real-estate-for-400000.html', 'snippet': 'A 1720 stone house in upstate New York; a pair of cabins in Sedona, Ariz.; and a duplex condo in Chicago.', 'lead_paragraph': 'COXSACKIE, N.Y.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/22/greathomesanddestinations/22gh_wyg/22gh_wyg-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subT