': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5e7cd4aa-afd0-55fd-8adc-c19bd4d1ef47', 'word_count': 152, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5e7cd4aa-afd0-55fd-8adc-c19bd4d1ef47'}, {'abstract': 'Brian Lam, editor of Gizmodo, is leaving the popular gadget and technology site to explore other opportunities.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/22/brian-lam-gizmodo-editor-moves-on/', 'snippet': 'Brian Lam, editor of Gizmodo, is leaving the popular gadget and technology site to explore other opportunities.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Brian Lam, editor of Gizmodo, is leaving Gawker’s popular gadget and technology site to explore other\xa0opportunities. Mr. Lam told David Carr on the Media Decoder blog that he has become less interested in covering technology and is now more focused on the effects technology has on society. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Brian Lam, Gizmodo Editor, Moves On', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-06-22T21:39:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/220a4089-ce06-5b04-801f-a37c841d6e8a', 'word_count': 61, 'uri': 'nyt://article/220a4089-ce06-5b04-801f-a37c841d6e8a'}, {'abstract': 'Kawal Singh Ahluwalia built guest cottages so his daughter and son could spend more time at his home in what is known as the Hamptons of Mumbai.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2011/06/22/greathomesanddestinations/20110622_location.html', 'snippet': 'Kawal Singh Ahluwalia built guest cottages so his daughter and son could spend more time at his home in what is known as the Hamptons of Mumbai.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Kawal Singh Ahluwalia built guest cottages so his daughter an