undup includes a Dropbox security faux pas; Verizon ending unlimited mobile data plans; Facebook's planned Music Dashboard; new web address suffixes. J.D.'s tech tip: Using the Windows 7 System Maintenance troubleshooter.", 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/audio/2011/06/23/technology/personaltech/23techtalk_pod.html', 'snippet': "Silicon Valley is bubbling over with chatter about big investments in startups that are barely off the ground. Bettina Edelstein speaks with Times technology reporter Claire Cain Miller about risky startups and why they're getting so much attentio...", 'lead_paragraph': "Silicon Valley is bubbling over with chatter about big investments in startups that are barely off the ground. Bettina Edelstein speaks with Times technology reporter Claire Cain Miller about risky startups and why they're getting so much attention. The inventor Dean Kamen is known for creating the Segway, among other things, and he's also behind a group called FIRST that aims to get young people interested in science, technology and engineering. J.D. Biersdorfer chats with Kamen about that and the winning project for the organization's Global Innovation Award. The news roundup includes a Dropbox security faux pas; Verizon ending unlimited mobile data plans; Facebook's planned Music Dashboard; new web address suffixes. J.D.'s tech tip: Using the Windows 7 System Maintenance troubleshooter.", 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Claire Cain Miller on risky startups; Dean Kamen, Legos and education; news.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Podcasts', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-22T22:02:15+0000', 'document_type': 'audio', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'subsection_name': 'Personal Tech', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://audio/4e4a1533-18f1-5571-93a2-b891c4e7c95f', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://audio/4e4a1533-18f1-5571-93a2-b891c4e7c95f'}, {'abstract': '“Expedition Impossible” on ABC shows contestants in a Moroccan desert.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/23/arts/television/expedition-impossible-on-abc.html', 'snippet': '“Expedition Impossible” on ABC shows contestants in a Moroccan desert.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As forms of American aggression go, sending a few dozen ambassadors of cultural misunderstanding to a foreign country with cameras in tow ranks as minor. But shows like “Expedition Impossible,” which emphasize the traveler over the destination, qualify as invasions just the same.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/23/arts/EXPEDITION/EXPEDITION-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 345, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/23/arts/EXPEDITION/EXPEDITION-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 345}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/23/arts/EXPEDITION/EXPEDITION-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 714, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/23/arts/EXPEDITION/EXPEDITION-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/23/arts/EXPEDITION/EXPEDITION-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'American Stereotypes Trek Across a Moroccan Desert', 'kicker': 'Television Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'American Stereotypes Trek Across a Moroccan Desert', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'ke