://article/158f528b-b96e-57f9-9d9c-b4a3150d9cb4'}, {'abstract': 'James Kudelka’s take on “Cinderella” is at American Ballet Theater through Saturday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/23/arts/dance/kudelkas-cinderella-at-american-ballet-theater-review.html', 'snippet': 'James Kudelka’s take on “Cinderella” is at American Ballet Theater through Saturday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'James Kudelka manages something fairly remarkable in his version of “Cinderella,” which American Ballet Theater performed on Tuesday in the first of a seven-performance run at the Metropolitan Opera House. He succeeds in creating a fairy-tale ballet entirely devoid of charm, a “Cinderella” that is for neither children nor adults and that somehow misses nearly every theatrical moment in the familiar story.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/23/arts/CINDERELLA/CINDERELLA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 349, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/23/arts/CINDERELLA/CINDERELLA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 349}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/23/arts/CINDERELLA/CINDERELLA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 718, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/23/arts/CINDERELLA/CINDERELLA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/23/arts/CINDERELLA/CINDERELLA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Note to Self: A Good Pair of Shoes Always Ends Up Paying for Itself', 'kicker': 'Dance Review', 'content_kicker': N