 presentation amid gravestones.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The ferry departed from Battery Park City under a glorious sky on Monday evening. The freshening breeze seemed to promise a respite from the 24-hour news cycle as we set off for the Governors Island Alliance’s Summer Gala. But the chirping of birds seemed only to remind guests of tweeting of a different sort. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/23/nyregion/NOCTURNALIST1/NOCTURNALIST1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/23/nyregion/NOCTURNALIST1/NOCTURNALIST1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/23/nyregion/NOCTURNALIST1/NOCTURNALIST1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/23/nyregion/NOCTURNALIST1/NOCTURNALIST1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/23/nyregion/NOCTURNALIST1/NOCTURNALIST1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'At Island Party, Bivalves, Birds and Beautiful Views', 'kicker': 'Nocturnalist', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'At Island Party, Bivalves, Birds and Beautiful Views', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Meeks, Gregory W', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Broadway Cares/Equity Fights AIDS', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kramer, Larry (1935- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}