on two of the victims and shot them from behind.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The first one to die was the pharmacist.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/24/nyregion/24shoot1/24shoot1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 819, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Judge Denies Bail to Suspect in Drugstore Killings', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Officials Describe Brutal Killings at Drugstore as Suspect Is Denied Bail', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drugstores', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Medford (NY)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drugs (Pharmaceuticals)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drug Abuse and Traffic', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Laffer, David', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brady, Melinda', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-23T15:48:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Al Baker and Joseph Goldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Al', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Baker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Joseph', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Goldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/90717508-32f8-5e31-9738-afef5b093479', 'word_count': 1001, 'uri': 'nyt://article/90717508-32f8-5e31-9738-afef5b093479'}, {'abstract': 'This week: Jon Pareles on the Cloud as salvation for massive