net companies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — French legislators have dropped plans for a tax on online advertising that had come to be known, somewhat misleadingly, as the Google tax.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': "France Drops Plans for 'Google Tax'", 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': "France Drops Plans for 'Google Tax'", 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Taxation', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Google Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Legislatures and Parliaments', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-23T16:28:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eric Pfanner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eric', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pfanner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c574df4c-28a0-5ab5-97dc-91cb17a7640b', 'word_count': 320, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c574df4c-28a0-5ab5-97dc-91cb17a7640b'}, {'abstract': 'The chief of Airbus said the aerospace industry must increase its production capacity in the next four years to fill a wave of aircraft orders.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/24/business/global/24airshow.html', 'snippet': 'The chief of Airbus said the aerospace industry must increase its production capacity in the next four years to fill a wave of aircraft orders.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LE BOURGET, France — Airbus capped off a frenetic week of new aircraft sales Thursday with a record-setting $18.2 billion order from AirAsia, the Malaysian low-cost airline. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The N