o have lived through decades of war, President Obama’s planned troop reduction feels like history repeating itself.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For many people in Afghanistan, President Barack Obama’s announcement of American troop withdrawals seems like history repeating itself. The Russians left this country, too, and so did the British.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Afghans Imagine a Country Without Foreign Forces', 'kicker': 'At War', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Taliban', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-23T21:18:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sharifullah Sahak', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sharifullah', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sahak', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c2d90f80-3b46-5da2-ba86-b1a721c3de8c', 'word_count': 433, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c2d90f80-3b46-5da2-ba86-b1a721c3de8c'}, {'abstract': 'Words are at the core of the annual group show by Visual AIDS at La MaMa La Galleria.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/24/arts/design/mixed-messages-aids-art-words.html', 'snippet': 'Words are at the core of the annual group show by Visual AIDS at La MaMa La Galleria.', 'lead_paragraph': 'La MaMa La Galleria', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '29', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘MIXED MESSAGES’: ‘A(I)DS, Art + Words’', 'kicke