he area.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/24/arts/music/classical-musicopera-listings-for-june-24-30.html', 'snippet': 'A selected guide to classical music performances in New York and the area.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Classical', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Classical Music/Opera Listings for June 24-30', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Listings', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Caramoor International Music Festival', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'River to River Festival (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bard Music Festival', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-23T22:21:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/09a3dbbd-2dc1-5314-8c1b-44339a4effd7', 'word_count': 1646, 'uri': 'nyt://article/09a3dbbd-2dc1-5314-8c1b-44339a4effd7'}, {'abstract': 'Cameron Diaz has found her down-and-dirty element in “Bad Teacher,” a broad comedy that threatens to get ugly and more or less succeeds on that threat.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/24/movies/cameron-diaz-in-bad-teacher-review.html', 'snippet': 'Cameron Diaz has found her down-and-dirty element in “Bad Teacher,” a broad comedy that threatens to get ugly and more or less succeeds on that threat.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In “Bad Teacher,” a breezily crude comedy about unladylike pleasures like guzzling booze, swearing at children and being mean because, well, you can be, Cameron Diaz taps into her inner thug. It’s a beautiful thing. A performer with a gift for light comedy and a comically ductile face that can work in fascinating counterpart to her rocking hot body (as her character would say), Ms. Diaz has found her down-and-dirty element in the kind of broad comedy that threatens to get ugly and more or less succeeds on that threat.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/24/arts/BAD-span/BAD-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/24/arts/BAD-span/BAD-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/24/arts/BAD-span/BAD-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/24/arts/BAD-span/BAD-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/24/arts/BAD-span/BAD-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'When the Teacher Gets High Marks in the Raunchy and the Profane', 'kicker': "Movie Review | 'Bad Teacher'", 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'When the Teacher Gets High Marks in the Raunchy and the Profane', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Diaz, Cameron', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kasdan, Jake', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Timberlake, Justin', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Segel, Jason', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-23T22:21:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Manohla Dargis', 'person': [{'first