om/2011/06/23/no-jeter-no-problem/', 'snippet': 'The Yankees have performed well without Derek Jeter in the lineup, meaning his return will force them to change things that have been working.', 'lead_paragraph': 'No team in the American League has won more games than the Yankees since June 14, when a certain milestone-chasing shortstop landed on the disabled list. Is there a correlation between Derek Jeter’s injury and the Yankees’ surge? Good question, and a complicated one.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'No Jeter? No Problem', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gardner, Brett', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jeter, Derek', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Swisher, Nick', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-23T22:27:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Shpigel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shpigel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a6dbdc99-6908-58cf-8615-5f391c040130', 'word_count': 428, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a6dbdc99-6908-58cf-8615-5f391c040130'}, {'abstract': 'A selected guide to pop, rock, folk and other music performances in New York and the area.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/24/arts/music/pop-and-rock-listings-for-june-24-30.html', 'snippet': 'A selected guide to pop, rock, folk and other music performances in New York and the area.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Pop', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New Y