soners in Afghanistan and others will get a closer look when it comes to the Senate floor.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Senate Armed Services Committee has voted for a sweeping and bipartisan package redefining the rules for detaining terrorism suspects, including giving military judges the power to review the cases of prisoners in Afghanistan and mandating military detention for important Qaeda suspects — even if they are captured on United States soil.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Senate Offers Revised Rules for Suspects of Terrorism', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Senate Offers Revised Rules For Suspects Of Terrorism', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Detainees', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate Committee on Armed Services', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-24T02:41:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Charlie Savage', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Charlie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Savage', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/87039fec-daf0-535f-8ca4-c040ee04cb5b', 'word_count': 618, 'uri': 'nyt://article/87039fec-daf0-535f-8ca4-c040ee04cb5b'}, {'abstract': 'High gas prices and tight supplies of many popular compact models have pushed the price of some used cars, like the Toyota Prius, close to the list price of a new one.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/24/business/24auto.html', 'snippet': 'High gas prices and tight supplies of many popular compact models have pushed the price of some used cars, like the Toyota Prius, close to the list price of a new one.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Cars are not supposed to be a good investment. But Spencer Hunter, an Oregon patent lawyer, recently turned a small profit selling his 13-month-old Toyota Prius.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/24/us/AUTOS/AUTOS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/24/us/AUTOS/AUTOS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/24/us/AUTOS/AUTOS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Used Gas Sippers, Keeping That New-Car Value', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Used Gas Sippers, Keeping That New-Car Value', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fuel Efficiency', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prices (Fares, Fees and Rates)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hybrid Vehicles', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sales', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-24T02:46:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nick Bunkley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bunkley', 'qualifier': None, 'titl