ies come pouring out. But they are not just about the big one that got away — these yarns have a political edge.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/24/us/24CNCFISHERMAN/24CNCFISHERMAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 720, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '2 Fishermen, Crusaders for Their Turf', 'kicker': 'Chicago News Cooperative', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '2 Fishermen, Crusaders For Their Turf', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Lake Michigan', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Illinois', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Invasive Species', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Carp (Fish)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-24T04:17:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kari Lydersen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kari', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lydersen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/72aa0168-2f7f-59d4-9230-c0fc7ac5842c', 'word_count': 788, 'uri': 'nyt://article/72aa0168-2f7f-59d4-9230-c0fc7ac5842c'}, {'abstract': 'After almost a decade of efforts, nurses at Our Lady of the Resurrection Medical Center are finally set to cast their votes for or against unionization.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/24/us/24cncwarren.html', 'snippet': 'After almost a decade of efforts, nurses at Our Lady of the Resurrection Medical Center are finally set to cast their votes for or against unionization.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s easier to be elected president than to win a union representation election these