mes Magazine, about what he likes to wear, and about his visit to the Milan and Paris shows. I loved the splashy effect of his scarves against his light blue suit.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Dwyane Wade in the Front Row', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Men and Boys', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wade, Dwyane', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Saint Laurent, Yves', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-24T16:58:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Cathy Horyn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Cathy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Horyn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2bdb728d-70f3-5bae-818e-641337ef2b38', 'word_count': 65, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2bdb728d-70f3-5bae-818e-641337ef2b38'}, {'abstract': 'St. Martin of Tours, a Catholic school in the Bronx, closed this week after serving the community for 86 years.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/nyregion/100000000879108/the-last-days-of-saint-matin-of-tours.html', 'snippet': 'St. Martin of Tours, a Catholic school in the Bronx, closed this week after serving the community for 86 years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'St. Martin of Tours, a Catholic school in the Bronx, closed this week after serving the community for 86 years.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/23/nyregion/video-catholic/video-catholic-articleLarge.jpg', 'heig