a6921331', 'word_count': 236, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3cd91e58-16b6-554e-aa56-51c2a6921331'}, {'abstract': 'Readers share their stories of how they or their family members used (or plan to use) reverse mortgage proceeds.', 'web_url': 'https://bucks.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/24/making-the-reverse-mortgage-decision/', 'snippet': 'Readers share their stories of how they or their family members used (or plan to use) reverse mortgage proceeds.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In this weekend’s Your Money column, I look at what the decision by Bank of America and Wells Fargo to leave the reverse mortgage business will mean for the product and its future. (I actually think both will be back to originating these mortgages within a decade, but that’s another column.)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Making the Reverse Mortgage Decision', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mortgages', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bank of America Corporation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-24T18:28:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ron Lieber', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ron', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lieber', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5b3103f0-ed6f-5350-a18c-dcd45f99b6d1', 'word_count': 156, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5b3103f0-ed6f-5350-a18c-dcd45f99b6d1'}, {'abstract': 'Nuclear Regulatory Commission staff members voiced frustration over a decision to halt an evaluation of Yucca Mountain as a waste site.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/25/science/earth/25nrc.html', 'snippet': 'Nuclear Regulatory Commission staff members voiced frustration over a decision to halt an evaluation of Yucca Mountain as a waste site.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — In an unusual public dissent, staff members of the Nuclear Regulatory Commission told a House subcommittee on Friday that they were frustrated by a boss’s decision to halt their evaluation of a site in Nevada as a future repository for the nation’s nuclear waste.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Staff Criticize Nuclear Regulator for Halting Evaluation', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Nuclear Agency Workers Denounce Project’s Halt', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Nuclear Regulatory Commission', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuclear Wastes', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-24T18:30:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Science', 'subsection_name': 'Environment', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matthew L. Wald', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matthew', 'middlename': 'L.', 'lastname': 'Wald', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2897e431-7296-5f29-9f9c-e884b3a10282', 'word_count': 798, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2897e431-7296-5f29-9f9c-e884b3a10282'}, {'abstract': 'A champion of writing talent and a Pulitzer Prize winner himself for editorial writing, F. Gilman Spencer also led newspapers in Philadelphia, Denver and Trenton.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/25/nyregion/f-gilman-spencer-ny-daily-news-editor-in-the-80s-dies-at-85.html', 'snippet': 'A champion of writing talent and a Pulitzer Prize winner himself for editorial writing, F. Gilman Spencer also led newspapers in Philadelphia, Denver and Trenton.', 'lead_paragraph': 'F. Gilman Spencer, who was known for his freewheeling style and sharp eye for writing talent as the editor of four newspapers, including The Philadelphia Daily News and The Daily News in New York, died on Friday in Manhattan. He was 85.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/25/nyregion/obit-SPENCER/obit-SPENCER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 833, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/25/nyregion/obit-SPENCER/obit-SPENCER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/25/nyregion/obit-SPENCER/obit-SPENCER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'F. Gilman Spencer, Ex-Editor of Daily News, Dies at 85', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'F. Gilman Spencer, 85, Newspaper Editor', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Newspapers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Spencer, F Gilman', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Daily News, The', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pulitzer Prizes', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Denver Post', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Philadelphia Daily News', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-24T18:37:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Grimes', 'person': [{'firstname': 