n-religious-exemptions-for-marriage-measure/', 'snippet': 'The language to protect religious institutions from obligations to recognize same-sex marriage had been one of the stumbling blocks to passage in the Legislature.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ALBANY — The Cuomo administration and legislative leaders have reached agreement on language to protect religious institutions from obligations to recognize same-sex marriage, two people involved in the negotiations said on Friday afternoon, potentially paving the way for a vote on the marriage legislation.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Consensus Reached on Religious Exemptions in Gay Marriage Bill', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Same-Sex Marriage, Civil Unions and Domestic Partnerships', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-24T20:14:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicholas Confessore and Michael Barbaro', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Confessore', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barbaro', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6bed0136-0a33-5f0b-b4b7-d3a35b2cbab4', 'word_count': 348, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6bed0136-0a33-5f0b-b4b7-d3a35b2cbab4'}, {'abstract': 'A process that once relied on gatekeepers can now be circumvented by a computer.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/24/friending-your-birth-mom/', 'snippet': 'A process that once relied on gatekeepers can now be circumvented by a computer.', 'lead_paragraph':