lie Kaufman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Leslie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kaufman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3988fd57-2ac8-53b6-9244-72026fa34b92', 'word_count': 243, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3988fd57-2ac8-53b6-9244-72026fa34b92'}, {'abstract': 'Paul Sullivan’s Wealth Matters column looks at various analyses of the wealthy and asks what’s in them for everyone else.', 'web_url': 'https://bucks.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/24/following-the-rich/', 'snippet': 'Paul Sullivan’s Wealth Matters column looks at various analyses of the wealthy and asks what’s in them for everyone else.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In his Wealth Matters column this week, Paul Sullivan considers the various surveys and analyses done of and for the rich. He says all the time and money put to looking at the wealthy, particularly when most people are feeling anything but wealthy, raises questions about the value of the information. Could anything from the various reports help others?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Following the Rich', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Foreign Investments', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'High Net Worth Individuals', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sullivan, Paul', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-24T21:08:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bucks Editors', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bucks', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Editors', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/57bf3b80-2e7d-509b-a5b2-7d87ea72ba98', 'word_count': 114,