tchen, David Tanis praises freshly dug new potatoes.', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/24/summers-here-have-a-potato/', 'snippet': 'In this week’s City Kitchen, David Tanis praises freshly dug new potatoes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In this week’s City Kitchen, an ode to a seasonal delight, freshly dug new potatoes, coming soon to a farmers’ market near you. Nothing better. Of course you can boil them, but baking them in parchment with garlic and herbs shows off their ethereal sweetness. Count on at least half a pound per person — there won’t be leftovers. By the way, they’re bound to go with whatever you’re having for the Fourth.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Summer’s Here. Have a Potato.', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-06-24T22:37:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Tanis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tanis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/aeac9fa7-f2be-5b1a-bdcd-2252adf9cf62', 'word_count': 129, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aeac9fa7-f2be-5b1a-bdcd-2252adf9cf62'}, {'abstract': 'This weekend’s gay pride festivities are unfolding as the State Legislature moves toward a vote on same-sex marriage.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/24/plans-for-festivities-move-ahead-as-gay-marriage-vote-looms/', 'snippet': 'This weekend’s gay pride festivities are unfolding as the State Legislature moves toward a vote on same-sex marriage.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This weekend’s gay pride festivities in New York City are unfolding as the State Legislature lurches toward a vote on same-sex marriage. Organizers are preparing for anything from violence to public outbreaks of euphoria, depending on the outcome.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Plans for Festivities Move Ahead as Gay Marriage Vote Looms', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-06-24T22:37:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3086da8d-72b1-5aa4-826d-07c32cbebae3', 'word_count': 38, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3086da8d-72b1-5aa4-826d-07c32cbebae3'}, {'abstract': "In this homemade video, Pip Decker and Meghan Kober hail a cab and recall how they met at a mutual friend's wedding in Williamsburg, Va.", 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/fashion/weddings/100000000872522/meghan--pip.html', 'snippet': "In this homemade video, Pip Decker and Meghan Kober hail a cab and recall how they met at a mutual friend's wedding in Williamsburg, Va.", 'lead_paragraph': "In this homemade video, Pip Decker and Meghan Kober hail a cab and recall how they met at a mutual friend's wedding in Williamsburg, Va.", 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/24/sports/video-vows-usergen-pipmeghan/video-vows-usergen-pipmeghan-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/24/sports/video-vows-usergen-pipmeghan/video-vows-usergen-pipmeghan-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/24/sports/video-vows-usergen-pipmeghan/video-vows-usergen-pipmeghan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/24/sports/video-vows-usergen-pipmeghan/video-vows-usergen-pipmeghan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Meghan & Pip', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-24T22:39:42+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'subsection_name': 'Weddings', 'byline': {'original': 'None None', 'person': [{'firstname': 'None', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'None', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/c22302c0-5838-59ed-9547-3f59cef09c3b', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/c22302c0-5838-59ed-9547-3f59cef09c3b'}, {'abstract': 'Two independent films — Azazel Jacobs’s “Terri” and David Robert Mitchell’s “Myth of the American Sleepover” — revise and reinvigorate a cherished American genre.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/26/movies/terri-and-the-myth-of-the-american-sleepover.html', 'snippet': 'Two independent films — Azazel Jacobs’s “Terri” and David Robert Mitchell’s “Myth of the American Sleepover” — revise and reinvigorate a cherished American genre.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WHEN it comes to the teen movie, as with many well-defined genres, familiarity is often part of the point. But a pair of new American indies — “Terri” (opening Friday) and “The Myth of the American Sleepover” (opening July 22) — show that the conventions of the high-school film provide a useful shorthand even as they present room for nuance and complication. “Terri,” a character study and unlikely buddy movie named for its outsize protagonist, tackles the evergreen subject of adolescent alienation. Drifting from one slumber party to another, “Myth” borrows the night-in-the-life structure associated with two classics of the genre, “American Graffiti” and “Dazed and Confused.” ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/26/arts/TERRI-1/TERRI-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/26/arts/TERRI-1/TERRI-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/26/arts/TERRI-1/TERRI-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/26/arts/TERRI-1/TERRI-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/26/arts/TERRI-1/TERRI-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Creating an Adolescence for the Ages', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Creating an Adolescence for the Ages', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Teenagers and Adolescence', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-24T22:47:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dennis Lim', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dennis', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lim', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ad7228c5-258d-5dfa-968d-966664f3ee0c', 'word_