bstract': 'Three brave souls spent an evening studying whether earplugs, a funny hat or fingers in the ears could best bring some quiet in a noisy city.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/26/nyregion/in-a-noisy-city-peace-and-quiet-is-an-illusion.html', 'snippet': 'Three brave souls spent an evening studying whether earplugs, a funny hat or fingers in the ears could best bring some quiet in a noisy city.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My two friends and I don’t expect a Nobel Prize. We don’t expect to have a bridge or a building named after us. None of the great scientists think in those terms while pursuing their breakthroughs; they think only of the good their research might do for humanity. ', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/26/nyregion/26jpCRITIC1/26jpCRITIC1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/26/nyregion/26jpCRITIC1/26jpCRITIC1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/26/nyregion/26jpCRITIC1/26jpCRITIC1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/26/nyregion/26jpCRITIC1/26jpCRITIC1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/26/nyregion/26jpCRITIC1/26jpCRITIC1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Could You Pipe Down? My Ears Thank You', 'kicker': 'City Critic', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Could You Pipe Down? My Ears Thank You', 'name': None, 'seo': 