rsey Nets basketball team, Mikhail D. Prokhorov, was elected leader of a Russian political party on Saturday in the first foray of a big businessman into politics here in nearly a decade.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/26/world/asia/26russia/26russia-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/26/world/asia/26russia/26russia-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Billionaire Owner of New Jersey Nets Takes Helm of Party in Russia', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Billionaire Owner of New Jersey Nets Takes Helm of Party in Russia', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Prokhorov, Mikhail D', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New Jersey Nets', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-25T13:38:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew E. Kramer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': 'E.', 'lastname': 'Kramer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/034ea17f-8dda-5f69-9010-225e0ffb53f3', 'word_count': 837, 'uri': 'nyt://article/034ea17f-8dda-5f69-9010-225e0ffb53f3'}, {'abstract': 'From southern Niger, guest blogger Noreen Connolly, one of “Two Win a Trip with Nicholas Kristof” winners for 2011, writes about a family on the brink: The father has river blindness, the starving, pregnant mother has an infected leg, and the two children are hungry.', 'web_url': 'https://kristof.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/25/helping-a-starving-family-in-niger/', 'snippet': 'From southern Niger, guest blogger Noreen Connolly, one of “Two Win a Trip with Nicholas Kristof” winners for 2011, writes about a family on the brink: The father has river blindness, the starving, pregnant mother has an infected leg, and the two ...', 'lead_paragraph': 'Saumya Dave, a student, and Noreen Connolly, a teacher, are the 2011 “Win A Trip” winners and are currently traveling with Nick through parts of North and West Africa. Noreen’s fifth post is from Niger. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Helping a Starving Family in Niger', 'kicker': 'Nicholas Kristof', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-06-25T14:00:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Noreen Connolly', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Noreen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Connolly', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/268802b3-bebc-58b4-9f73-2538a59672e7', 'word_count': 950, 'uri': 'nyt://article/268802b3-bebc-58b4-9f73-2538a59672e7'}, {'abstract': 'Scenes from the Paris Fashion Week photo diary of Kevin Tachman.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/25/photos-of-the-moment-john-galliano-4/', 'snippet': 'Scenes from the Paris Fashion Week photo diary of Kevin Tachman.', 'lead_paragraph': ' NYTD.fullScreenSlideShowFactory.createSlideshow("#583", 592, 490, true, chameleonData);', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Photos of the Moment | John Galliano', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'su