in Beijing for an American technology company. Another employee who had been managing the office and overseeing the project was returning home in 2008. ', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/26/business/26sbnPRE/26sbnPRE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/26/business/26sbnPRE/26sbnPRE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/26/business/26sbnPRE/26sbnPRE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Into the Bustle of China’s Boom', 'kicker': 'Preoccupations', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Into The Bustle Of China’s Boom', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARCHITECTURE', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Shanghai (China)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'NBBJ', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-25T18:36:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'SundayBusiness', 'section_name': 'Job Market', 'byline': {'original': 'By Larry Goetz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Larry', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Goetz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5342042a-105f-5631-befc-7b7d071cbc53', 'word_count': 868, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5342042a-105f-5631-befc-7b7d071cbc53'}, {'abstract': 'The Chicago Anti-Eviction campaign, a group of low-income-housing advocates, is working to match homeless people, like Martha Biggs and her family, with empty homes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/26/us/26cnchomeless.html', 'snippet': 'The Chicago Anti-Eviction campaign, a group of low-income-housing advocates, is working to match homeless people, like Martha Biggs and her family, with empty homes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a giggly voice, a small homeless girl with blue-framed glasses chased her younger brother and sister around the front porch of a long-deserted two-flat on the South Side, chanting, “Fight, fight, fight, ’cause housing is a human right.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27B', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/26/us/26CNCHOMELESS/26CNCHOMELESS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 365, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/26/us/26CNCHOMELESS/26CNCHOMELESS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 365}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/26/us/26CNCHOMELESS/26CNCHOMELESS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 665, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/26/us/26CNCHOMELESS/26CNCHOMELESS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/26/us/26CNCHOMELESS/26CNCHOMELESS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Foreclosed Home Is a Risky Move for Homeless Family', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Foreclosed Home Is a Risky Move For Homeless Family', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chicago (Ill)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', '