res students for science, technology, engineering and math jobs, just sent its first graduating class into the world.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/26/us/26cncaustin.html', 'snippet': 'Despite its problems, Austin Polytechnical Academy, which prepares students for science, technology, engineering and math jobs, just sent its first graduating class into the world.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Standing in the hallway of Austin Polytech, Stran’Ja Burge, 18, adjusted her burgundy graduation cap and shifted her weight restlessly from one foot to the other. Her four-year-old high school was about to graduate its first senior class, but for Ms. Burge, the end of high school had still not registered.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/26/us/26CNCAUSTIN1/26CNCAUSTIN1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/26/us/26CNCAUSTIN1/26CNCAUSTIN1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/26/us/26CNCAUSTIN1/26CNCAUSTIN1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/26/us/26CNCAUSTIN1/26CNCAUSTIN1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/26/us/26CNCAUSTIN1/26CNCAUSTIN1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Troubled High School Celebrates a Milestone', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Troubled High School Celebrates a Milestone', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chicago (Ill)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Austin Polytechnical Academy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (K-12)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-25T18:56:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Meribah Knight', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Meribah', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Knight', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1ff1d69b-8697-52d4-8b20-a7d606ac312b', 'word_count': 1227, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1ff1d69b-8697-52d4-8b20-a7d606ac312b'}, {'abstract': 'Shawn Green has written a book called “The Way of Baseball,” with Gordon McAlpine, about his Zen mentality.', 'web_url': 'https://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/25/the-zen-of-shawn-green/', 'snippet': 'Shawn Green has written a book called “The Way of Baseball,” with Gordon McAlpine, about his Zen mentality.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Shawn Green, a former outfielder, looked trim and fit while standing in the Mets’ dugout before a game a few weeks ago. Green is just 38, but he retired after the 2007 season, when he hit .291.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Zen of Shawn Green', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Green, Shawn', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-25T19:01:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tyler Kepner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tyler', 'middlename': None, 'lastna