'From an early age, Catherine Elizabeth Greig knew the life of a moll. By about 20, she had married a Boston firefighter named Bobby McGonagle, joining a family with close ties to a gang that was part of the Irish mafia in their South Boston neighborhood. Violence and shootouts were not uncommon as gangs warred for control of the rackets. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/26/us/GREIG-1/GREIG-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 988, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/26/us/GREIG-1/GREIG-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/26/us/GREIG-1/GREIG-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Gangster’s Gal Was Loyal to the End of Life on the Run', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Gangster’s Girlfriend Was Loyal to the End Of a Life on the Run', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bulger, James J', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Boston (Mass)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Organized Crime', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-25T20:48:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Katharine Q. Seelye', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Katharine', 'middlename': 'Q.', 'lastname': 'Seelye', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/04fffa68-9247-533c-8aa9-bb66bf5c200e', 'word_count': 1257, 'uri': 'nyt://article/04fffa68