incipals, cooling rooftops, and bicycle sharing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Here are some of the pilot programs started by the Bloomberg administration: ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Sampling of Experiments From the Bloomberg Laboratory', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Sampling of Experiments From the Municipal Laboratory', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloomberg, Michael R', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Local Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-27T00:48:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/aa330581-d62f-570f-a7ef-b793f7d79d9e', 'word_count': 389, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aa330581-d62f-570f-a7ef-b793f7d79d9e'}, {'abstract': 'The administration has made unprecedented use of initiatives labeled experimental to test ideas quickly and efficiently — and, critics say, undemocratically.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/27/nyregion/bloomberg-pilot-programs-avoid-red-tape-and-public-review.html', 'snippet': 'The administration has made unprecedented use of initiatives labeled experimental to test ideas quickly and efficiently — and, critics say, undemocratically.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It has never been easy for a mayor to get things done in New York City, where every government proposal must navigate a thicket of community groups, policy boards, and empowered neighborhood gadflies who can blackball a project in a blink.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/27/