oup Urges New Cyberattacks', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computer Security', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hackers (Computers)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Anonymous (Internet Group)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Lulz Security', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-27T01:38:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Riva Richmond and Nick Bilton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Riva', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Richmond', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Nick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bilton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ca92e35b-685d-59f6-b8c8-00af24d8bebb', 'word_count': 1117, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ca92e35b-685d-59f6-b8c8-00af24d8bebb'}, {'abstract': 'The federal effort includes an updated list of the top 25 programming errors that enable the most serious hacker attacks.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/27/technology/27secure.html', 'snippet': 'The federal effort includes an updated list of the top 25 programming errors that enable the most serious hacker attacks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Homeland Security Department plans to unveil on Monday a new system of guidance intended to help make the software behind many services — be they Web sites or power grids — less susceptible to hacking. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/27/business/secure/secure-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 896, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headlin