{'abstract': 'Despite the alarming sight of a plant surrounded by sandbag walls and a dozen pumps, experts said the situation was in hand in Fort Calhoun, Neb.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/28/us/28nuke.html', 'snippet': 'Despite the alarming sight of a plant surrounded by sandbag walls and a dozen pumps, experts said the situation was in hand in Fort Calhoun, Neb.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FORT CALHOUN, Neb. — When safety regulators arrive for a tour of a nuclear plant, the operators usually give the visitors a helmet, safety glasses and earplugs. When Gregory B. Jaczko, chairman of the Nuclear Regulatory Commission, got to the Fort Calhoun plant on Monday morning, the Omaha Public Power District offered him a life jacket. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/28/us/NUKE/NUKE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 340, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/28/us/NUKE/NUKE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 340}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/28/us/NUKE/NUKE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 629, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/28/us/NUKE/NUKE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/28/us/NUKE/NUKE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Nuclear Plant’s Vital Equipment Dry, Officials Say', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Nuclear Plant’s Vital Equipment Dry, Officials Say', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject