/06/28/hague-prosecutor-calls-for-libya-to-arrest-qaddafi/', 'snippet': 'The chief prosecutor of the International Criminal Court in The Hague called on Col. Muammar el-Qaddafi’s inner circle to arrest him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One day after the International Criminal Court in The Hague issued arrest warrants for Col. Muammar el-Qaddafi, one of his sons and his intelligence chief, accusing them of crimes against humanity during the first two weeks of the uprising in Libya, the court’s chief prosecutor called on the Libyan leader’s inner circle to arrest him.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hague Prosecutor Calls for Libya to Arrest Qaddafi', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-06-28T15:13:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Mackey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mackey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a355de62-9611-5921-a751-9cc788b8adb2', 'word_count': 317, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a355de62-9611-5921-a751-9cc788b8adb2'}, {'abstract': 'Yeast extract helps bring a liverlike flavor to this vegetarian pâté.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/01/health/nutrition/01recipehealth.html', 'snippet': 'Yeast extract helps bring a liverlike flavor to this vegetarian pâté.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This is an adaptation of a dish that I created in my early vegetarian days, when we cooked a lot with soybeans — although nobody really liked them. It occurred to me one day to add Marmite or Savorex, yeast extracts with an intense, somewhat meaty taste, and to use other seasonings from traditional pâtés to achieve a liverlike flavor. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0,