ignature projects of Chief Justice John G. Roberts Jr.: defending free speech and curbing big lawsuits.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/29/us/29scotus.html', 'snippet': 'The justices continued work on two signature projects of Chief Justice John G. Roberts Jr.: defending free speech and curbing big lawsuits.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Supreme Court term that ended Monday was marked by accomplishment and anticipation. The court continued its work on two signature projects of Chief Justice John G. Roberts Jr.: defending free speech and curbing big lawsuits. And it dropped occasional hints about the blockbusters on the horizon. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/29/us/scotus-1/scotus-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 548, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/29/us/scotus-1/scotus-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/29/us/scotus-1/scotus-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Significant Term, With Bigger Cases Ahead', 'kicker': 'News Analysis', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Significant Term, With Bigger Cases Ahead', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Supreme Court', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-28T16:16:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam Liptak', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Liptak', 'qualifier': None, 'title