amily friend facing pedophilia charges, has been fined $2,000 by the city’s Conflicts of Interest Board.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ex-Public Housing Official Is Fined', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Andrews, Earl Jr', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Conflicts of Interest Board (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-28T19:56:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andy Newman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Newman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c77496f7-adde-53c9-b06d-78fad5d4df0d', 'word_count': 233, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c77496f7-adde-53c9-b06d-78fad5d4df0d'}, {'abstract': 'Senator Richard J. Durbin of Illinois will try again to win passage of the Dream Act, which would help the children of some illegal immigrants.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/28/a-second-try-on-immigration-act/', 'snippet': 'Senator Richard J. Durbin of Illinois will try again to win passage of the Dream Act, which would help the children of some illegal immigrants.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Senator Richard J. Durbin spoke to a crowd of capped and gowned young people, pumping then up with encouraging words as sustenance for their journey ahead. “When I look around this room, I see America’s future,” he said.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Second Try on Immigration Act', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-06-28T19:56:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'sect