 describing America as “absolutely awash with easily obtainable firearms.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg is back on the air with another political ad, and this time his focus is guns.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bloomberg Ad Invokes Al Qaeda in Fighting Illegal Guns', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gun Control', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Political Advertising', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloomberg, Michael R', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gadahn, Adam Yahiye', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Mayors Against Illegal Guns', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-28T22:25:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By David W. Chen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Chen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8536cc78-4246-50e3-8640-5d462d8edf14', 'word_count': 368, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8536cc78-4246-50e3-8640-5d462d8edf14'}, {'abstract': 'In “Polytechnique,” the director Denis Villeneuve reconstructs events from 1989, when a disturbed young man went on a rampage against women at a Montreal technical school.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/29/movies/polytechnique-by-denis-villeneuve-review.html', 'snippet': 'In “Polytechnique,” the director Denis Villeneuve reconstructs events from 1989, when a disturbed young man went on a rampage against women at a Montreal technical school.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A disturbed young man goes on a rampage in a public place, shooting down innocents and, usually, taking his own life. Such events are not exactly routine, but they are not rare, either, and those not directly affected may have trouble recalling the specific details of a particular massacre once the media frenzy has died down.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/29/arts/Poly/Poly-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 256, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/29/arts/Poly/Poly-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 256}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/29/arts/Poly/Poly-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 437, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/29/arts/Poly/Poly-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/29/arts/Poly/Poly-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Fictional Killer of Women Who Is All Too Familiar', 'kicker': "Movie Review | 'Polytechnique'", 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Fictional Killer of Women Who Is All Too Familiar', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'School Shootings', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Villeneuve, Denis', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-28T22:28:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By A.O. Scott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'A.', 'middlename': 'O.', 'lastname': 'Scott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], '