to stifle live coverage of militants’ attacks, Afghan journalists managed to file updates on a raid on the Hotel Intercontinental in Kabul on Tuesday, using Twitter.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/28/afghans-report-on-kabul-attack-via-twitter/', 'snippet': 'Despite an attempt to stifle live coverage of militants’ attacks, Afghan journalists managed to file updates on a raid on the Hotel Intercontinental in Kabul on Tuesday, using Twitter.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As my colleague Alissa Rubin reports, attackers stormed the Intercontinental Hotel in the Afghan capital, Kabul, Tuesday night, and witnesses said shooting and a loud explosion were heard as Afghan security forces rushed to the scene.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Afghans Report on Kabul Attack via Twitter', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mohseni, Saad', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Taliban', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Twitter', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kabul (Afghanistan)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-28T23:07:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Mackey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mackey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8e882b3a-e9c1-5126-a629-55a1d9390788', 'word_count': 562, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8e882b3a-e9c1-5126-a629-55a1d9390788'}, {'abstract': 'An Oyster fest at Jimmy’s No. 43; a culinary walking tou