ed drinks together become something less than the sum of the parts at a new East Village restaurant.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To stand out in New York, a new restaurant needs a fresh concept. Retro? Done. Ditto cocktails and Greenmarket fare. What if you put all three together?', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/29/dining/BRIEFS-2/BRIEFS-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/29/dining/BRIEFS-2/BRIEFS-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/29/dining/BRIEFS-2/BRIEFS-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/29/dining/BRIEFS-2/BRIEFS-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/29/dining/BRIEFS-2/BRIEFS-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Beagle', 'kicker': 'Dining Briefs | Recently Opened', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Beagle', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'East Village (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-28T23:07:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'subsection_name': 'Dining & Wine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jane Black', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jane', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Black', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organizat