l Nadal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mardy Fish has never beaten Rafael Nadal, and will have to play the match of his life to win on Wednesday. He has to formulate a shrewd game plan, matching his strengths against Nadal’s one or two less than stellar tendencies, then quickly recalibrate when Nadal makes a subtle adjustment. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What Fish Needs to Do Against Nadal', 'kicker': 'Straight Sets', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wimbledon Tennis Tournament', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fish, Mardy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nadal, Rafael', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-29T02:53:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By Geoff Macdonald', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Geoff', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Macdonald', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2ded4733-8ed2-581d-9597-8c090eaf3adc', 'word_count': 818, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2ded4733-8ed2-581d-9597-8c090eaf3adc'}, {'abstract': 'The Yankees battered the Brewers’ Zack Greinke and won for the 13th time in 17 games as the Red Sox succumbed to Cliff Lee and fell one and a half games back in the A.L. East.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/29/sports/baseball/yankees-batter-greinke-and-brewers.html', 'snippet': 'The Yankees battered the Brewers’ Zack Greinke and won for the 13th time in 17 games as the Red Sox succumbed to Cliff Lee and fell one and a half games back in the A.L. East.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The quirks of interleague scheduling yielded two nearly identical matchups Tuesday night, about 100 miles apart, for the American League elite. As a former Cy Young Award winner ushered his division-leading team into Yankee Stadium, the Boston Red Sox drew a similar challenge down the turnpike in Philadelphia. And for that stroke of serendipity, the Yankees are thankful.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/29/sports/PINS/PINS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/29/sports/PINS/PINS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/29/sports/PINS/PINS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 656, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Yankees Make Quick Work of a Pitcher They Once Coveted', 'kicker': 'Yankees 12, Brewers 2', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Yankees Make Quick Work of a Pitcher They Once Coveted', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Greinke, Zack', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Teixeira, Mark', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Milwaukee Brewers', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-29T02:55:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Shpigel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shpigel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://art