at.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/29/new-york-philharmonics-music-director-vows-to-restore-parks-series/', 'snippet': 'Alan Gilbert, music director of the New York Philharmonic, has vowed to restore free concerts in the city’s parks next year after the orchestra’s decision to suspend the series this summer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There will be no free concerts in the parks for the New York Philharmonic this summer. But Alan Gilbert, the orchestra’s music director, has given his word that situation will change in 2012. “I am making a personal promise that these beloved free concerts will return next summer and continue for many years to come,” he wrote in a letter sent via e-mail to The New York Times on Wednesday, following the publication of a critic’s notebook lamenting the orchestra’s decision to suspend the series, which began in 1965.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New York Philharmonic’s Music Director Vows to Restore Parks Series', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bocelli, Andrea', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gilbert, Alan', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mehta, Zarin', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Philharmonic', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'CENTRAL PARK (NYC)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-29T20:03:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Larry Rohter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Larry', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rohter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_materi