h a parade of models neutrally and rather simply attired (for Lanvin standards), ascending a staircase from below and walking in a giant circle, melding into one continuous rotating mass until each model in succession retreated back downstairs. Maybe it was the stirring music. Maybe it was the simplicity of a stronger, more utilitarian look that seemed straight out of Claire Denis’s meditation on the military, “Beau Travail.” The\xa0gauzy gray mix of a layered double-breasted jacket worn with an airy duster and semisheer trousers tucked into combat boots was heroically beautiful.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Paris Top 5 | Lanvin', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-06-29T21:10:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bruce Pask', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bruce', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pask', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/70f67841-af38-5fdf-89ca-cd490d1ae861', 'word_count': 114, 'uri': 'nyt://article/70f67841-af38-5fdf-89ca-cd490d1ae861'}, {'abstract': "Xavier Cha's film for the de La Cruz Collection.", 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/t-magazine/100000000887660/clip-body-drama.html', 'snippet': "Xavier Cha's film for the de La Cruz Collection.", 'lead_paragraph': "Xavier Cha's film for the de La Cruz Collection.", 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/29/t-magazine/video-tmag-delacruz/video-tmag-delacruz-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/29/t-magazine/video-tmag-delacruz/video-tmag-del