ion-review-spring-mens-wear-collections-in-paris.html', 'snippet': 'Top collections, from Givenchy and Comme des Garçons, turn their backs on the sobriety seen elsewhere.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — MAYBE it’s too many hours on Twitter that causes people to reduce fashion shows to a check-off list of essentials, but whatever it is, writers at the spring men’s collections here were ticking the appropriate boxes: globalism, gender games, the new sobriety.', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/30/fashion/Z-PARIS-P1-3/Z-PARIS-P1-3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 308, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/30/fashion/Z-PARIS-P1-3/Z-PARIS-P1-3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/30/fashion/Z-PARIS-P1-3/Z-PARIS-P1-3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Paris, Sensuality Saves the Day', 'kicker': 'Fashion Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Paris, Sensuality Saves the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Men and Boys', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Saint Laurent, Yves', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Givenchy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Lanvin', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Comme des Garcons', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Paris Fashion Week', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hermes International SA',