inner party, you can always get through to someone impossible to reach.', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/30/fashion/Z-UP-CLOSE/Z-UP-CLOSE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 655, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/30/fashion/Z-UP-CLOSE/Z-UP-CLOSE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/30/fashion/Z-UP-CLOSE/Z-UP-CLOSE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Gay Rights Power Player Who Wields a Mighty Phone', 'kicker': 'Up Close', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Gay Rights Power Player Who Wields a Mighty Phone', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homosexuality', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Empire State Pride Agenda', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ellner, Brian', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Same-Sex Marriage, Civil Unions and Domestic Partnerships', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-29T22:15:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jan Hoffman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hoffman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/165fadd1-3b06-5167-a3a1-bbd106ca7bb1', 'word_count': 1114, 'uri': 'nyt://article/165fadd1-3b06-5167-a3a1-bbd106ca7bb1'}, {'abstract': 'In a program at the Cooper-Hewitt National Design Museum, children took Chair 69, the classic piece by the modernist Alvar Aalto, and added paint, ribbons, felt and other adornments.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/06/30/garden/children-reimagine-a-classic-aalto-chair.html', 'snippet': 'In a program at the Cooper-Hewitt National Design Museum, children took Chair 69, the classic piece by the modernist Alvar Aalto, and added paint, ribbons, felt and other adornments.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WHAT is that sound coming from a cemetery in Finland? Might it be Alvar Aalto spinning in his grave? A New Yorker has just painted a big red heart on Chair 69, a seriously minimal piece that the architect designed 76 years ago. Do the eyes deceive, or are those ribbons wound around the chair’s stiles and cross rail? And plastic jewels stuck on the seat?', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/30/garden/30artek-span/30artek-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 374, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/06/30/garden/30artek-span/30artek-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 374}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/30/garden/30artek-span/Artek-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/06/30/garden/30artek-span/30artek-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/06/30/garden/30artek-span/30artek-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumb