ies/jason-bateman-anchor-of-all-star-comedy-ensembles.html', 'snippet': 'A former sitcom star and Teen Wolf, Jason Bateman has become a consummate ensemble player.', 'lead_paragraph': '“JUSTIN BATEMAN!” Kirstie Alley exclaimed.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/03/arts/BATEMAN-1/BATEMAN-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/03/arts/BATEMAN-1/BATEMAN-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/03/arts/BATEMAN-1/BATEMAN-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/03/arts/BATEMAN-1/BATEMAN-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/03/arts/BATEMAN-1/BATEMAN-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Team Player Who Blends Into the Comedy', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Team Player Who Blends Into the Comedy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ACTORS AND ACTRESSES', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bateman, Jason', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-30T12:00:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jonah Weiner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jonah', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weiner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3d12a6a3-f635-57f5-8413-cf26ad4c63f3', 'word_count': 1785, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3d12a6a3-f635-57f5-8413-cf26ad4c63f3'}, {'abstract': 'Scandals be damned. The goal of marriage, argues Dan Savage — devoted husband, proud father, sex columnist — should be stability, not monogamy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/03/magazine/infidelity-will-keep-us-together.html', 'snippet': 'Scandals be damned. The goal of marriage, argues Dan Savage — devoted husband, proud father, sex columnist — should be stability, not monogamy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last month, when the New York congressman Anthony Weiner finally admitted that he had lied, that his Twitter account had not been hacked, that he in fact had sent a picture of his thinly clad undercarriage to a stranger in Seattle, I asked my wife of six years, mother of our three children, what she thought. More specifically, I asked which would upset her more: to learn that I was sending racy self-portraits to random women, Weiner-style, or to discover I was having an actual affair. She paused, scrunched up her mouth as if she had just bitten a particularly sour lemon and said: “An affair is at least a normal human thing. But tweeting a picture of your crotch is just weird.”', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/03/magazine/03infidelity1/03infidelity1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 413, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/03/magazine/03infidelity1/03infidelity1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/03/magazine/03infidelity1/03infidelity1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Married, With Infidelities', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Married, With Infidelities', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marriages', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homosexuality', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Savage, Dan', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADULTERY', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Same-Sex Marriage, Civil Unions and Domestic Partnerships', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-30T12:00:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Oppenheimer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Oppenheimer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/aa6305ef-b1c4-52ee-9174-0f183bc77108', 'word_count': 5381, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aa6305ef-b1c4-52ee-9174-0f183bc77108'}, {'abstract': "But the International Atomic Energy Agency also made 11 recommendations, including the drafting of a detailed plan for long-term disposal of the rare earth refinery's radioactive waste.", 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/01/business/global/01lynas.html', 'snippet': "But the International Atomic Energy Agency also made 11 recommendations, including the drafting of a detailed plan for long-term disposal of the rare earth refinery's radioactive waste.", 'lead_paragraph': 'The International Atomic Energy Agency in Vienna said Thursday that the design and planned operations policies of a giant rare earth refinery being built in Malaysia meet international standards.', 'print_section': 'B', 'pr