set of the once un-upsettable Roger Federer and Murray is just the guy who never wins any tournaments of consequence and plays with such outward discomfort it appears as if someone has starched his underwear.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'With Federer Gone, All Eyes on Murray', 'kicker': 'Leading Off', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'With Federer Gone, All Eyes on Murray', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Murray, Andy (1987- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wimbledon Tennis Tournament', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-30T15:46:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lynn Zinser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lynn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zinser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/86f95f17-2057-5ad1-a276-ff870518bfe2', 'word_count': 727, 'uri': 'nyt://article/86f95f17-2057-5ad1-a276-ff870518bfe2'}, {'abstract': 'An airstrike in Paktia Province killed Ismal Jan, the man NATO officials say helped organize the hotel raid on Tuesday at the Intercontinental Hotel in Kabul.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/07/01/world/asia/01afghan.html', 'snippet': 'An airstrike in Paktia Province killed Ismal Jan, the man NATO officials say helped organize the hotel raid on Tuesday at the Intercontinental Hotel in Kabul.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KABUL, Afghanistan — An airstrike in southeastern Afghanistan killed an insurgent leader who was involved in organizing the suicide assault on the Intercontinental Hotel here Tuesday, NATO officials said. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Airstrik