ent-your-team-loses-or-you-dont-like-the-film/', 'snippet': 'More on the Avon Theater’s no-refunds policy for “The Tree of Life.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'When a Connecticut theater, the Avon in Stamford, posted a sign saying it wouldn’t give refunds to patrons walking out of “The Tree of Life,” the news ricocheted around the Web. (A sampling of posts is here, here and here.) But Adam Birnbaum, the theater’s director of film programming, says that the move has been widely misinterpreted as a snub of insufficiently arty filmgoers. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'No Refunds in the Event Your Team Loses or You Don’t Like the Film', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Stamford (Conn)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-30T19:45:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephanie Goodman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephanie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Goodman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d8c4405e-e8b1-514b-aea3-426041ea9aac', 'word_count': 232, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d8c4405e-e8b1-514b-aea3-426041ea9aac'}, {'abstract': 'The Las Conchas wildfire in northern New Mexico has blazed through nearly 93,000 acres since Sunday and stands poised to become the largest in the state’s history, according to officials.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/06/30/wildfire-continues-to-burn-near-nuclear-facility-in-new-mexico/', 'snippet': 'The Las Conchas wildfire in northern New Mexico has blazed through nearly 93,000 acres since Sunday and stands poised to become the largest in the state’s history, according to officials.', 'lead_paragra