-gem-keeps-yankees-hot.html', 'snippet': 'C.C. Sabathia struck out 13 Brewers in the Yankees’ 5-0 defeat of Milwaukee Thursday at Yankee Stadium.', 'lead_paragraph': 'C. C. Sabathia struck out Milwaukee Brewers left fielder Corey Hart, a former teammate, for the second time Thursday, and Hart slammed his useless bat and dropped his batting helmet where he stood. Hart’s only consolation, maybe, was that two teammates struck out three times.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/01/sports/01yankees1/01yankees1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 771, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/01/sports/01yankees1/01yankees1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/07/01/sports/01yankees1/01yankees1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sabathia Pitches Gem and Keeps Yankees Hot', 'kicker': 'Yankees 5, Brewers 0', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Coming Collision, Lots of Momentum: Mowing Down Brewers, Sabathia Helps Yankees Complete a Sweep', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Braun, Ryan', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sabathia, C C', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Milwaukee Brewers', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-30T20:11:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By