pet': 'Questions on a sports fanatic, on friendly wedding dress advice and on gift registries.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My husband is a sports fanatic. We will be attending a close friend’s wedding in Europe on the evening of (in his view) the “game of the century.” Worse, his favorite team is playing. The reception will be held in a mansion that certainly has a TV in it. How rude would it be for my husband to ask the bridegroom if he could slip in and out of the festivities to watch the game on one of the house’s televisions?Sherri, Washington', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2010/02/21/fashion/21social-1/21social-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2010/02/21/fashion/21social-1/21social-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Poor Reception for the Big Game', 'kicker': 'Social Q’s', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Poor Reception for the Big Game', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gifts', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Customs, Etiquette and Manners', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Friendship', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-06-30T22:19:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Philip Galanes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Philip', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Galanes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/78c112cf-3b0e-523e-8273-e00b5eb9eb2e', 'word_count': 